'use strict';
// Shattered Worlds - Hero Stories in Chinese: every story, relationship and Chronicle paragraph, English -> Chinese.
// Exact-string lookup like js/lang/*.js: if an English line in js/lore/*.js changes, change its key here too, or that line
// falls back to English. Fetched by js/lore/screen.js the first time the Hero Stories screen opens in this language.
SW.i18n.add('zh', {
  "A city of gold towers on anti-gravity pylons, built for the rich who fled the Ashfall War. The Noble Ring, the Spire, the Archive - and under it all, Halcyon's laboratories, where the Engine is fed. Aurelia is running out of power. It will not fall quietly.": "一座建在反重力塔柱上的黄金塔城，为逃离落灰战争的富人而建。贵族环区、尖塔、档案馆——而在这一切之下，是哈尔西恩的实验室，引擎就在那里被喂养。奥蕾莉亚的能源正在耗尽。它不会无声无息地坠落。",
  "What the war left between the sky and the tunnels: dunes, the poisoned Glowwild, the Crater and its Glass Sea, and pieces of Vharra's steppe that fell out of the tear and kept growing grass. Nobody rules the Surface. Plenty have tried. The Hidden Clans keep their village here, on a mountain no map shows.": "战争在天空与隧道之间留下的东西：沙丘、有毒的荧野、陨坑和它的玻璃之海，还有从裂隙里掉出来、照样长草的瓦拉草原碎块。没有谁统治地表。试过的倒不少。隐秘氏族的村落就在这里，在一座任何地图上都没有的山上。",
  "The old metro lines, where the poor went down and never came back up. Slums, scrapyards, the Pit Arena, the flooded Drowned Line, a shrine of paper and a garden of bone. Everything Aurelia throws away lands here, and Deepline makes something of it.": "旧地铁线路，穷人走了下去，就再也没上来。贫民窟、废料场、深坑竞技场、被水淹没的溺亡线，一座纸做的神社，一座骨头的花园。奥蕾莉亚扔掉的一切都落到这里，而深线总能把它变成点什么。",
  "The Engine did not only tear two worlds into ours. It tore a hole in the dark between worlds, and the hole never quite closed. What came through it was never human, or stopped being human on the way. Halcyon calls them anomalies. They call this world the near side.": "引擎撕进我们世界的，不只是另外两个世界。它还在世界之间的黑暗里撕开了一个洞，那个洞始终没有完全合上。从洞里过来的东西从来就不是人，或者在半路上就不再是了。哈尔西恩称它们为异常体。它们则把这个世界称作此岸。",
  "Born by the Frozen Harbour. Torn through; woke in a Halcyon test tank.": "生于冰封港湾。被卷入裂隙，醒来时已在哈尔西恩的实验舱里。",
  "Halcyon Subject 31, escaped": "哈尔西恩31号实验体，已出逃",
  "Long dark-blue braid, a pale test-subject suit with gold trim, and a slender blade of ice that hums when she breathes.": "深蓝色的长辫，镶金边的浅色实验体服，还有一柄纤细的冰刃，随她的呼吸嗡嗡作响。",
  "She woke in a cracked tank in Med-Lab Sector 7 with a number instead of a name, and the first thing she saw was a Husk standing over the doctor: a grey shape nobody else in the room could see. Halcyon wanted to know why she could. She did not tell them.": "她在7区医疗实验室一个开裂的实验舱里醒来，没有名字，只有编号。她看见的第一样东西，是站在医生身旁的一个空壳：一道灰色的影子，房间里别人谁也看不见。哈尔西恩想知道她为什么看得见。她没告诉他们。",
  "Her power is Resonance, a note held so long the air gives up and freezes. Pulse Burst, Winterline, Shatterline: every one of them is singing, in the end. Isolde, two tanks down, taught her to keep her voice low. Maren kept her heart going on the nights the tests went too far. Pyra burned the way out.": "她的力量是共鸣：一个音拖得太久，久到空气放弃抵抗，冻结成冰。脉冲爆发、寒冬线、碎冰线，说到底，全都是歌唱。隔着两个实验舱的伊索德教她压低嗓音。测试做得太过火的那些夜里，是玛伦让她的心脏继续跳动。出去的路，是派拉烧出来的。",
  "Halcyon told her a Deepline boy called Kael had been sent to hunt the escaped Subjects. She believed it, for one fight. Now she sings for everyone the Engine ever bottled, and when the Last Verse lands she says it plainly:": "哈尔西恩告诉她，一个叫凯尔的深线少年被派来追捕出逃的实验体。她信了，信了一场战斗那么久。如今她为每一个被引擎装进瓶子的人歌唱。当绝唱落下，她说得很直白：",
  "Born by the Frozen Harbour. Torn through; woke in Cryo Vault 9.": "生于冰封港湾。被卷入裂隙，醒来时已在9号冷冻库。",
  "Halcyon Subject 52, the falconer": "哈尔西恩52号实验体，驯鹰人",
  "Silver-white hair, a deep blue high-collared coat, a crystal ice staff, and a small bird of glittering ice perched on her hand.": "银白色的头发，深蓝色高领大衣，一根水晶般的冰杖，手上停着一只闪闪发亮的小冰鸟。",
  "In her world, Isolde kept the white falcons of the eyrie over the harbour. The tear took the eyrie, the harbour and the birds. It left her one falcon, made of ice now, and Cryo Vault 9, where Halcyon kept her colder than she had ever been. She did not mind the cold. She minded the glass.": "在她的世界里，伊索德照看着港湾上方鹰巢中的白隼。裂隙夺走了鹰巢、港湾和那些鸟，只给她留下一只猎鹰，如今是冰做的；还留下了9号冷冻库，哈尔西恩把她关在那里，冷得前所未有。她不在乎冷。她在乎的是那层玻璃。",
  "She speaks softly and the air freezes to listen: Ice Shards, Frost Nova, an Ice Bird that hunts four at once. In the vault she was the eldest of the young Subjects, and she raised Nyra the only way she knew - the way a falconer raises a chick, by never once doing the flying for her.": "她轻声说话，空气便冻结下来倾听：冰棱、霜冻新星、一次能猎杀四个目标的冰隼。在冷冻库里，她是年轻实验体中最年长的，她用自己唯一懂得的方式带大了妮拉——就像驯鹰人养大雏鹰那样，从没替她飞过一次。",
  "Corvin's crows went for her bird on her first night free, and she has not forgiven a crow since. Brann thinks the winter is his; Isolde lets him think it. When her falcon stoops on the last one standing, she only smiles:": "她重获自由的第一个夜晚，科尔文的乌鸦就扑向了她的鸟。从那以后，她再没原谅过任何一只乌鸦。布兰以为冬天是他的；伊索德由着他这么以为。当她的猎鹰俯冲扑向最后一个还站着的人，她只是微微一笑：",
  "Born on Vharra's windy ridge. Torn through; fell to the bottom of Deepline.": "生于瓦拉多风的山脊。被卷入裂隙，一路坠到了深线的最底层。",
  "Courier of the Paper Post": "纸鹤邮驿的信使",
  "Windswept teal-green hair under a white headband, a pale green tunic with long flowing sashes, wind and leaves spiralling round his open hand.": "白色头带下是被风吹乱的青绿色头发，浅绿色短袍上飘着长长的腰带，风与落叶在他摊开的手掌周围盘旋。",
  "On Vharra, Gale ran the ridge where the wind never stops, and the kite clans said the wind loved him a little too much. The tear dropped him at the bottom of Deepline's Vent Stacks, a thousand metres under the sky. He fell down Stack Four and did not break. Then he found the updraft and rode it all the way back up.": "在瓦拉，盖尔在风永不停歇的山脊上奔跑，风筝氏族都说，风爱他爱得有点过头了。裂隙把他扔到了深线排风塔的最底下，离天空足有一千米。他从四号排风塔摔下去，却没摔坏。然后他找到了上升气流，乘着它一路回到了顶上。",
  "He was looking for his little sister Sora, whose kite he had seen go up through the tear while he went down. He found her flying letters between the towers of Aurelia, and he has not let her out of his sight since, which she hates.": "他在找妹妹索拉——他往下坠的时候，看见她的风筝穿过裂隙往上飞去。他找到她时，她正在奥蕾莉亚的高塔之间飞送信件。从那以后他就没让她离开过视线，这一点她恨透了。",
  "Wind Blade, Updraft, a Cyclone that juggles whole crowds, and when he is cornered he is simply never there. Tarn calls that cheating; Gale calls it wind. When the Hurricane drops, he grins at whoever is left on the floor:": "风刃、上升气流、能把一整群人抛着玩的旋风；被逼到墙角时，他干脆就不在那儿。塔恩管这叫作弊；盖尔管这叫风。当飓风落下，他冲着还倒在地上的人咧嘴一笑：",
  "Born by the Frozen Harbour, where he captained the sea wall. Torn through.": "生于冰封港湾，曾在那里统领海堤守军。被卷入裂隙。",
  "Halcyon Subject 12, knight of the Proving Hall": "哈尔西恩12号实验体，试炼大厅的骑士",
  "A tall knight in dented steel plate, a closed helm whose visor slit glows pale gold, a dark red cape and a greatsword the length of a door.": "高大的骑士，身披凹痕累累的钢制板甲，闭合的头盔面甲缝隙透出淡金色的光，身后是暗红色斗篷，手中一柄门板那么长的巨剑。",
  "He was the captain of the harbour wall once, sworn to stand between the ice and the people behind it. The tear swallowed the wall and every soldier on it but him. Halcyon found him in the rubble, still on guard over nothing, and gave him a new wall to hold: the Proving Hall, where the Director's champions are made.": "他曾是港口城墙的队长，发誓挡在寒冰与身后的人们之间。裂隙吞没了城墙和墙上的每一个士兵，唯独留下了他。哈尔西恩在废墟里找到他时，他仍在守卫着一片虚无。于是他们给了他一道新的墙去守：试炼大厅，总监的勇士们在那里被打造出来。",
  "He fights slow and certain. Oathkeeper takes a blow and answers with the whole sword; Iron Tempest walks through anything; Judgment marks a foe and lets the sky decide. For a year he was the Director's finest knight, because he believed the Director's word that the Subjects were protected, not spent.": "他出手缓慢而笃定。守誓者硬接一击，再以整把剑回敬；钢铁风暴无物可挡；审判标记一名敌人，然后交由天空裁决。有一年时间，他是总监麾下最出色的骑士，因为他相信总监的话：实验体是被保护的，而不是被消耗的。",
  "Then Vesper showed him the Husks in the Engine's feed lines. Aldric broke his oath to the Director that night, to keep the older one. Skysplitter falls three times, and he lowers the blade:": "后来，韦斯帕带他看了引擎供能管线里的空壳。那一夜，奥德瑞背弃了对总监的誓言，为的是守住更早的那一个。裂空斩三度落下，他放低了剑：",
  "Born by the Frozen Harbour, at a blue forge. Torn through; woke in the Burn Ward.": "生于冰封港湾的一座蓝色熔炉旁。被卷入裂隙，醒来时已在烧伤病房。",
  "Halcyon Subject 44, the one who got away": "哈尔西恩44号实验体，逃掉的那一个",
  "Flame-orange hair tied back so it streams like fire, a dark crimson jacket with a gold emblem, burning forearms and a fireball in her open palm.": "火橙色的头发向后束起，像火焰一样飘扬；暗绯红色夹克上有金色徽记；前臂燃着火，摊开的掌心托着一团火球。",
  "At home there was a blue forge that never went out, and an old smith who called her in from the cold. Halcyon wanted to bottle that heat. Elixa mixed the serum, Pyra drank what she was told, and for six weeks the Burn Ward ran on her the way a furnace runs on coal.": "家乡有一座从不熄灭的蓝色熔炉，还有一个会把她从寒风里叫进屋的老铁匠。哈尔西恩想把那份热量装进瓶子。艾莉克莎调好血清，派拉照吩咐喝下。整整六个星期，烧伤病房靠她运转，就像熔炉靠煤运转。",
  "On the seventh week the bottle broke. Pyra burned the Burn Ward to the frame, walked out through her own fire with Nyra on her back, and has been setting things alight ever since: Fireball, Flame Ring, a Sun Flare that eats walls, Forge Breath when she is really angry.": "第七个星期，瓶子碎了。派拉把烧伤病房烧得只剩骨架，背着妮拉从自己的火里走了出来，从此一路点火至今：火球、炎环、能吞掉墙壁的日耀，真动怒时还有熔炉之息。",
  "Ashka of the Core Sump is the only one who ever burned hotter, and the only one Pyra calls sister. Kestra insists she is the real phoenix; Pyra insists on fighting her about it. When the Supernova falls, she looks over the ashes and asks, sweetly:": "核心污水坑的阿什卡是唯一烧得比她还烫的人，也是派拉唯一称作姐妹的人。凯斯特拉坚称自己才是真正的凤凰；派拉坚持为这事跟她打一架。当超新星落下，她扫视满地灰烬，甜甜地问：",
  "Born by the Frozen Harbour, keeper of the sea-wall lamp. Torn through.": "生于冰封港湾，守着海堤上的那盏灯。被卷入裂隙。",
  "Halcyon Subject 57, the Firing Gallery's marksman": "哈尔西恩57号实验体，射击廊的神射手",
  "A long brown ponytail, a dark olive hunting jacket with a yellow sash, one eye closed over a tall pale longbow drawn to full stretch.": "棕色长马尾，暗橄榄色猎装系着黄色腰带，闭起一只眼，拉满一张高大的浅色长弓。",
  "Yara lit the lamp on the sea wall at home, so the ships in the ice could steer by her. In Aurelia, Halcyon gave her the Firing Gallery and a target a mile away and told her it was the same job. It was not. The ships she guided home did not fall down afterwards.": "在家乡，雅拉负责点亮海堤上的那盏灯，好让冰海中的船只循着她找到方向。到了奥蕾莉亚，哈尔西恩给了她射击廊和一英里外的靶子，告诉她这是同一份工作。不是。她引回家的那些船，事后不会倒下。",
  "Her arrows hit harder the further they fly, so she stands very far back: Long Arrow, a Vault Shot that pins a man to the floor, Arrow Rain, a Sky Lance that comes down as light. Hart thinks distance is a spear's business; Jax thinks it is a pistol's. She has a running bet with both, and she is ahead.": "她的箭飞得越远，打得越狠，所以她总站得远远的：长箭、能把人钉在地上的跃射、箭雨、化作光芒落下的天枪。哈特认为距离是长枪的事；杰克斯认为那是手枪的事。她跟两人都有一场没完的赌局，目前她领先。",
  "Lux taught her to put light on the string. Now one arrow, drawn for a whole breath, runs the length of the world, and Yara lets it go like a lamp being lit:": "卢克丝教会了她把光搭上弓弦。如今一支箭，拉满整整一口气，便能从世界的这一头飞到那一头。雅拉松开它，就像点亮一盏灯：",
  "Born on Vharra's steppe. Torn through; woke in the Paper Shrine under Deepline.": "生于瓦拉草原。被卷入裂隙，醒来时已在深线地底的纸之神社。",
  "Founder of the Paper Post": "纸鹤邮驿的创始人",
  "A high black bun pinned with a white paper charm, a cream wrap jacket with crimson cuffs and sash, and paper cranes swirling round her open palm.": "高高的黑色发髻上别着一枚白色纸符，奶油色交领上衣配绯红袖口与腰带，纸鹤在她摊开的掌心周围盘旋。",
  "On a rainy day on the steppe a herder's daughter tore a page from the tally-book, folded it, and watched a bird stand up and look at her. Her father came in to find two daughters on the bed, and laughed until he had to sit down. Kiri has had a paper double ever since: whatever she does, it does again a moment later.": "草原上一个下雨天，一个牧人的女儿从记账本上撕下一页，折了起来，然后看着一只鸟站起身，望着她。她父亲进门时，看见床上坐着两个女儿，笑得不得不坐下来。从那以后，基里就有了一个纸做的分身：她做什么，它片刻之后就再做一遍。",
  "The tear dropped her in the Paper Shrine, where Deepline leaves folded wishes for the dead. She folded the wishes into one crane big enough to carry her, and flew it up the Vent Stacks: the first Deepliner to reach Aurelia without a ticket. With Sora and Gale she runs the Paper Post, carrying the letters Halcyon would rather nobody sent.": "裂隙把她扔进了纸之神社，深线人在那里为死者留下折好的心愿。她把那些心愿折成一只大得能载起她的纸鹤，乘着它沿排风塔一路飞上去：第一个没买票就到了奥蕾莉亚的深线人。如今她和索拉、盖尔一起经营纸鹤邮驿，递送那些哈尔西恩宁愿谁都别寄的信。",
  "Rook likes her because she is also more than one person. Rue hates her, because a copy of a copy is no use to anyone. When the Paper Dragon has gone through everyone, both Kiris bow together:": "鲁克喜欢她，因为她也不止一个人。露讨厌她，因为复制品的复制品对谁都没用。当纸龙从所有人身上碾过，两个基里一同鞠躬：",
  "Aurelia-born, in the undercroft beneath the gold.": "生于奥蕾莉亚，黄金之下的城底暗层。",
  "Hidden Clans, the Sky Clan's fire-fan": "隐秘氏族，天空氏族之火扇",
  "A long dark red ponytail, a dark crimson jacket with orange trim, and a great folding war fan with flames curling off its edge.": "暗红色长马尾，橙边的暗绯红色夹克，还有一把巨大的折叠战扇，扇缘卷着火焰。",
  "Kestra is a daughter of the Sky Clan, one of the Hidden Clans that never chose a layer. Hers chose the undercroft of Aurelia, the hot dark beneath the gold where the pylons hum and the city's waste heat rises. Her family has danced the fire-fan there for a hundred years, out of sight of the nobles walking on their roof.": "凯斯特拉是天空氏族的女儿。天空氏族是隐秘氏族之一，而隐秘氏族从不选择任何一层。她的氏族选了奥蕾莉亚的城底暗层：黄金之下那片炽热的黑暗，塔柱在那里嗡鸣，城市的废热从那里升起。她的家族在那里跳了一百年火扇舞，在他们屋顶上行走的贵族从来看不见。",
  "Fire first, then the fan to make it worse: Ember Breath sets them burning, Fan Gust blows the fire hotter, and burning enemies take her skills harder than anyone. When Phoenix Form wraps her, her Phoenix Dive comes down like a falling sun.": "先放火，再用扇子火上浇油：余烬吐息让敌人烧起来，扇风把火扇得更旺，而正在燃烧的敌人挨她的技能比谁都疼。当凤凰形态裹住她，她的凤凰俯冲便如坠落的太阳般砸下。",
  "Then Pyra walked out of the Burn Ward wearing a phoenix of her own, and Kestra took it personally. Eleven fights; nobody agrees on the score. Her clan-sister Lin keeps them both from burning the undercroft down. When Sunfall lands, Kestra snaps the fan shut:": "后来派拉从烧伤病房走了出来，身上披着一只属于自己的凤凰，凯斯特拉把这当成了私人恩怨。十一场架；比分谁也说不清。她的氏族姐妹琳负责不让她们俩把城底暗层烧光。当坠日落下，凯斯特拉啪地合上扇子：",
  "Born on Vharra's steppe, in the kite clans. Torn through - upward.": "生于瓦拉草原的风筝氏族。被卷入裂隙——往上。",
  "High flyer of the Paper Post": "纸鹤邮驿的高飞者",
  "Spiky pink hair, a sky-blue jacket, hanging from the string of a white and blue kite the size of a sail.": "粉色的刺猬头，天蓝色夹克，吊在一只白蓝相间、船帆大小的风筝线上。",
  "On the steppe of Vharra, Sora flew the biggest kite at the festival, and her big brother Gale held the other end. When the sky tore, the string snapped. Gale fell down. Sora went up, through the violet, and came out over the towers of Aurelia with nothing but a kite the size of a sail.": "在瓦拉草原上，索拉放着节庆上最大的风筝，哥哥盖尔握着线的另一头。天空撕裂时，线断了。盖尔往下掉。索拉往上飞，穿过那片紫色，从奥蕾莉亚的高塔上空钻了出来，身边只有一只船帆大小的风筝。",
  "She has hardly come down since. She glides between the spires carrying letters for the Paper Post, cuts loose with the String Cut, bombs from the Kite Bomber, and lands only for the Dive Bomb, which nobody enjoys. Once, on festival day, a lanky boy reached across a whole field for her tangled kite. Bando still claims he saved her.": "从那以后她几乎没下来过。她在尖顶之间滑翔，为纸鹤邮驿送信；放开手脚使出线切，从风筝轰炸上投弹，只有俯冲轰炸时才落地，而那一招谁都不喜欢。有一次，在节庆那天，一个瘦高的男孩隔着整片原野伸手去够她缠住的风筝。班多至今还说是他救了她。",
  "Mika is the only fighter who stays in the air longer, and Sora cannot stand it. When A Thousand Kites cut across the arena and fall, she waves from somewhere very high:": "米卡是唯一比她在空中待得更久的斗士，索拉对此忍无可忍。当千风筝划过竞技场、纷纷坠落，她在很高很高的地方挥着手：",
  "Surface-born, near the bell temple. Taken up to Aurelia as a child.": "生于地表，钟寺附近。幼时被带上了奥蕾莉亚。",
  "Star dancer of the Noble Ring's opera": "贵族环区歌剧院的明星舞者",
  "Long violet hair, a pink and white dance outfit, mid-spin inside loops of long pink silk ribbon.": "紫罗兰色长发，粉白相间的舞衣，正在一圈圈粉色长丝带中旋转。",
  "Coda learned rhythm as a child from the bell of Oda's temple on the Surface, counting the tolls with her feet. Then a smiling man in a porcelain mask offered her a stage in the sky. Pell took her up to Aurelia, made her the star of the Noble Ring's opera, and tied a string to every step she took.": "寇妲小时候跟着地表上奥达那座寺庙的钟声学会了节奏，用脚数着钟响。后来，一个戴着瓷面具、面带微笑的男人许给她一座天上的舞台。佩尔把她带上奥蕾莉亚，让她成了贵族环区歌剧院的明星，又在她迈出的每一步上都系了一根线。",
  "She danced for the Director's guests and carried their secrets back to Pell in her ribbons. She hated every bow. She hears music in every fight and fights on the beat: Ribbon Lash, Pirouette, a Grand Jete that throws the whole room up, a Spotlight that freezes her partner where she wants him.": "她为总监的宾客起舞，再把他们的秘密藏在丝带里带回给佩尔。每一次谢幕她都厌恶。她在每场战斗里都听得见音乐，踩着节拍出手：彩带鞭、旋转、把满屋子人掀上天的大跳，还有把舞伴定在她想要的位置上的聚光灯。",
  "Zara gave her a seat at the House Edge when she had nowhere else to sit; Mika taught her to leap without a net. The ribbons she fights with now are Pell's strings, cut one by one. When the Finale ends, she curtsies to an empty house:": "她无处可坐的时候，扎拉在庄家优势赌坊给了她一个座位；米卡教会她不用安全网也敢跳。她如今用来战斗的丝带，正是佩尔的线，被她一根一根剪断。当终曲结束，她向空无一人的观众席屈膝行礼：",
  "Deepline-born. Won her way up the Skylift, one hand at a time.": "生于深线。一手牌接一手牌，赢上了天梯。",
  "Owner of the Noble Ring's richest card room": "贵族环区最阔绰赌坊的老板",
  "A short black top hat with a gold band, a dark red waistcoat, and a fan of white playing cards with gold edges drifting round her.": "一顶系着金色饰带的黑色矮礼帽，一件暗红色马甲，一扇金边白色纸牌在她身边飘荡。",
  "Zara runs the House Edge, the richest card room on the Noble Ring, where Aurelia's nobles lose fortunes politely. She is not a noble. She was a Deepline card sharp who won her way up the Skylift one hand at a time, and she has never told anyone what she bet on the last one.": "扎拉经营着庄家优势赌坊，贵族环区最阔绰的赌坊，奥蕾莉亚的贵族们在那里彬彬有礼地输掉家产。她不是贵族。她曾是深线的老千，一手牌接一手牌赢上了天梯，而最后那一手她押了什么，她从没告诉过任何人。",
  "Every fight is a game of chance, and she stacked the deck: Card Toss draws from one to ten and a ten is a jackpot, House of Cards falls in four waves, a Wild Card might burn, freeze or heal. Lin stands behind her chair. The house's winnings go, quietly, down the Skylift to Deepline.": "每场战斗都是一场赌局，而她早就做好了牌：飞牌抽一到十，抽到十就是头奖；纸牌屋分四波落下；万能牌可能燃烧、冰冻，也可能治疗。琳站在她的椅子后面。赌坊赢来的钱，悄悄地顺着天梯流回深线。",
  "Jax knew her before the money. They do not discuss it, except across a table, armed. When All In comes down and the last card is the jackpot, as it always is, she tips her hat:": "杰克斯在她发财之前就认识她。这件事他们从不谈，除非隔着一张桌子，手里都握着家伙。当全押落下，最后一张牌照例是头奖，她轻抬帽檐：",
  "Born by the Frozen Harbour, the harbour's doctor. Torn through.": "生于冰封港湾，港湾的医生。被卷入裂隙。",
  "Halcyon Subject 21, doctor to the other Subjects": "哈尔西恩21号实验体，其他实验体的医生",
  "Long dark teal hair, a white healer's coat with sea-green sleeves, and a ribbon of sea water curling round her arm like a living whip.": "深青色长发，白色医者外袍配海绿色衣袖，一条海水凝成的缎带像活的鞭子一样缠在她臂上。",
  "At home she was the doctor who sat with fevered children until the fever went out with the tide. Halcyon made her Subject 21 and then, because she was better at it than their own staff, the doctor of all the other Subjects. Maren took the job. It was the only way to stay in the room with them.": "在家乡，她是那个守在发烧孩子身边、直到烧随退潮而去的医生。哈尔西恩把她编为21号实验体；后来，因为她比他们自己的医护人员做得更好，又让她当了所有其他实验体的医生。玛伦接下了这份工作。这是唯一能和他们待在同一个房间里的办法。",
  "Her power takes and gives: Brine Lash, a Tide Pool that hurts her enemies and heals her, an Undertow that drags them back, a Brine Bubble that bursts and mends her. She kept Nyra's heart going through the worst of the tests. She pulled a drowned woman called Nami out of Deepline's flooded line and argued with the sea until it gave her back.": "她的力量有取有予：盐潮鞭；伤敌又治己的潮池；把敌人拖回来的暗流；破裂后能修补她自身的盐泡。在最难熬的那些测试里，是她让妮拉的心脏一直跳着。她从深线被淹没的线路里拖出一个叫奈美的溺水女人，跟大海争论，直到它把人还了回来。",
  "She knows exactly what Elixa's serums did, because she treated it. She knows what Vesna charges for blood, because she has seen the bill. When Spring Tide comes in four times and goes out again, she pulls off her gloves:": "她清楚艾莉克莎的血清造成了什么，因为那些后果是她治的。她知道维斯娜为血开什么价，因为她见过账单。当大潮四度涨起又退去，她摘下了手套：",
  "Aurelia-born, Halcyon-trained.": "生于奥蕾莉亚，受训于哈尔西恩。",
  "Halcyon's chief alchemist, maker of the serums": "哈尔西恩首席炼金师，血清的调制者",
  "A long purple braid, a white lab coat with violet trim, three bubbling flasks of red, blue and green, and coloured smoke everywhere.": "紫色长辫，紫边白色实验袍，三只咕嘟冒泡的红、蓝、绿烧瓶，四处弥漫着彩色烟雾。",
  "Elixa was Halcyon's brightest chemist and its most dangerous, because she never wanted anything except to know what happens next. She mixed the serums that woke the Subjects' powers. She did not ask where the Subjects came from. She asked what happens if you add a second colour.": "艾莉克莎曾是哈尔西恩最聪明的化学家，也是最危险的那个，因为她什么都不想要，只想知道接下来会发生什么。她调制了唤醒实验体力量的血清。她没问过实验体从哪里来。她问的是：再加一种颜色会怎样。",
  "Red Flask burns, Blue Flask freezes, the Green Cauldron eats; a new colour on a marked enemy sets off a reaction, and the Grand Experiment throws all three at once. Then Pyra burned her laboratory down around her, and for the first time Elixa saw one of her results look back at her.": "红瓶灼烧，蓝瓶冰冻，绿釜吞噬；在已标记的敌人身上添一种新颜色便会引发反应，而伟大实验会把三种一齐砸出去。后来，派拉把她的实验室烧了个精光，她本人就站在火场中央。艾莉克莎第一次看到自己的一个实验结果回过头来看着她。",
  "She works with Ume now, buying Glowwild spores for a cure that might wake the Husks. Maren checks every flask. Pyra has not decided whether to forgive her. When the Magnum Opus rains down and everything reacts with everything, Elixa takes notes:": "如今她和梅合作，收购荧野的孢子，研制一种也许能唤醒空壳的解药。玛伦会检查她的每一只烧瓶。派拉还没决定要不要原谅她。当伟业倾泻而下，万物与万物相互反应，艾莉克莎在做笔记：",
  "Born on Vharra's steppe, a scholar. Torn through; woke in Aurelia's Archive.": "生于瓦拉草原，一名学者。被卷入裂隙，醒来时已在奥蕾莉亚的档案馆。",
  "Seal-writer of the Archive": "档案馆的封印书师",
  "A black topknot, a white robe with a crimson sash, a long calligraphy brush, and ribbons of black ink and crimson glyphs curling round her.": "黑色的顶髻，白袍系着绯红腰带，一支长长的书法毛笔，墨黑的丝缕与绯红的符文在她周身缭绕。",
  "In an old school on the steppe there were two students who could draw a line nobody could cross: a quiet boy called Sen, and Isa. The tear dropped her in Aurelia's Archive, where Halcyon hired her to do what she did best. Every contract on the Noble Ring, every law of the Director's, was sealed in Isa's ink.": "草原上一所古老的学堂里，有两个学生能画出一道谁也越不过去的线：一个叫森恩的安静男孩，还有伊莎。裂隙把她扔进了奥蕾莉亚的档案馆，哈尔西恩雇她去做她最擅长的事。贵族环区的每一份契约，总监的每一条法令，都是用伊莎的墨封印的。",
  "Every word she writes is a door she can slam: Ink Bolt leaves glyphs that burst underfoot, Brush Stroke cuts a wide arc, Seal Circle wakes and strikes four times, Binding Script holds a foe until every letter explodes. In the Archive she met Tessa, who had read the last page of everything. Tessa showed her the Director's.": "她写下的每一个字，都是一扇她能猛然关上的门：墨弹留下在脚下炸开的符文，一笔斩出一道宽弧，封印阵苏醒后连击四次，缚字困住敌人，直到每一个字都炸开。她在档案馆里遇见了泰莎——那个读过一切事物最后一页的人。泰莎给她看了总监的那一页。",
  "Orin opens doors; Isa closes them, and they have argued about which is harder ever since. Lin guards her when she writes the dangerous ones. When the Final Word falls across the sky, she lifts the brush:": "欧林开门；伊莎关门。哪一样更难，两人从那以后一直争到现在。她书写危险的字时，琳守在她身旁。当终字横贯天际落下，她提起了笔：",
  "Hidden Clans, the Sky Clan's open palm": "隐秘氏族，天空氏族之掌",
  "Long black hair, a white martial arts top and slate trousers, one open palm extended with rings of air rippling out of it.": "黑色长发，白色武术上衣配石板灰长裤，一只手掌张开前伸，一圈圈气流从掌心荡漾开去。",
  "Lin is a daughter of the Sky Clan, like Kestra, and the calmest person in Aurelia. She does not hit hard. She hits exactly: every fifth strike seals a pressure point, and the enemy forgets how to use their own power for a moment. She has never needed a sixth.": "琳和凯斯特拉一样是天空氏族的女儿，也是奥蕾莉亚最沉着的人。她出手不重。她出手精准：每到第五击便封住一处穴位，敌人会一时忘了怎么使用自己的力量。她从来不需要第六击。",
  "Zara hired her to stand behind a card table. She took the job because the House Edge sees everyone on the Noble Ring, and the Sky Clan wanted eyes there. Air Palm, a Turning Wall nothing can touch, Palm Rain, Heart Strike. Ivo, who trains on the Surface, calls her style soft. She has sealed him twice to make a point.": "扎拉雇她站在牌桌后面。她接下这份差事，是因为庄家优势赌坊能看见贵族环区的每一个人，而天空氏族想在那里安一双眼睛。空掌、无物能触及的回旋之壁、掌雨、心击。在地表修炼的伊沃说她的路数太软。为了说明这一点，她已经封过他两次。",
  "She keeps Kestra's fire off the undercroft's beams and Isa's brush hand safe while it writes. When the Hundred Palms close on everyone at once, she lets out her breath:": "她让凯斯特拉的火远离城底暗层的梁木，也护着伊莎执笔书写的那只手。当百掌同时合向所有人，她缓缓吐出一口气：",
  "Born by the Frozen Harbour, the lamplighter of the sea wall. Torn through.": "生于冰封港湾，海堤上的点灯人。被卷入裂隙。",
  "Halcyon Subject 77, of the Night Ward": "哈尔西恩77号实验体，出自夜间病房",
  "A slim figure wrapped in dark navy cloth with only the eyes showing, a long crimson scarf, a short blade in a reverse grip and stars between her fingers.": "纤瘦的身影裹在深藏青色的布料里，只露出一双眼睛；一条长长的绯红围巾，反手握着短刃，指间夹着飞星。",
  "At home, every lamp on the sea wall came alight at dusk and nobody saw who lit them: only a red scarf against the snow, already at the next lamp. Halcyon locked Vesper in the Night Ward and numbered her 77. She left most nights anyway, and Aurelia's lower alleys began to have lamps in them.": "在家乡，每到黄昏，海堤上的灯都会一盏盏亮起，却没人看见是谁点的：只有雪地里一抹红围巾，已经到了下一盏灯前。哈尔西恩把韦斯帕关进夜间病房，编为77号。可她大多数夜里照样溜出去，于是奥蕾莉亚底层的小巷里开始有了灯。",
  "You only see the scarf. Star Volley, a Smoke Step behind you, a Phantom Rush through everyone, a Pinned Shadow that nails you to the floor. Noct kept the same harbour in the dark: she lit it, he kept it clean. They found each other again in Halcyon's halls without a word.": "你只看得见那条围巾。星镖连发；烟遁到你身后；幻影突袭穿过所有人；钉影把你钉在地上。诺克特在黑暗中守着同一座港湾：她把它点亮，他把它清理干净。他们在哈尔西恩的走廊里重逢，一个字也没说。",
  "Moro thinks shadows are for hiding; Vesper thinks they are for walking through. It was Vesper who took Aldric down to the feed lines and showed him the Husks. When the Thousand Cuts have landed, she is already at the next lamp:": "莫罗认为影子是用来藏身的；韦斯帕认为影子是用来穿行的。正是韦斯帕带奥德瑞下到供能管线，让他看见了那些空壳。当千刃尽数落定，她已经站在下一盏灯前：",
  "Born on Vharra's steppe, with the hunting clans. Torn through; woke in the Beast Pens.": "生于瓦拉草原的狩猎氏族之中。被卷入裂隙；醒在兽栏。",
  "Hunter of the wastes": "荒原猎人",
  "A grey wolf-pelt hood over a shadowed face and glowing violet eyes, dark indigo armour, clawed steel gauntlets, and a snarling wolf made of violet lightning at his side.": "灰色狼皮兜帽下是一张隐在阴影里的脸和一双发光的紫眼，身披深靛色铠甲，戴着带爪的钢制护手，身旁一头紫色闪电化成的狼正龇牙低吼。",
  "Fenn rode with the hunting clans of Vharra, and his lightning runs on four legs. When the sky over the steppe tore open, he whistled up his storm-wolf and set it between the tear and the camp. It did not run when he fell. He woke in Halcyon's Beast Pens, in a cage built for something larger.": "芬恩曾随瓦拉的狩猎氏族驰骋草原，他的闪电用四条腿奔跑。草原上空被撕开的那天，他一声口哨唤来风暴之狼，让它挡在裂隙与营地之间。他倒下时，狼没有逃。他醒来时已身在哈尔西恩的兽栏，关在一只为更大的东西打造的笼子里。",
  "He bit through it. Chain Bolt leaps between three foes, Thunderclap paralyses a ring of them, the Thunder Wolf hunts on its own. On his way up out of Deepline he found a kid with static in his hair and the old storm-eye of Vharra scratched on his jacket. Fenn has been Kael's older brother ever since, whether either of them asked.": "他把笼子咬穿了。连环雷在三个敌人之间跳跃，霹雳让一圈敌人动弹不得，雷狼则自行狩猎。从深线往上走的路上，他遇见一个头发里噼啪带电的孩子，外套上刻着瓦拉古老的风暴之眼。从那以后，芬恩就一直是凯尔的大哥，不管两人有没有谁开过这个口。",
  "On the Surface he hunts what Halcyon lets loose. Kova wants to be every beast at once; Fenn thinks one wolf is plenty. Brann is the only one who out-howls him. When the Pack Howl has run its course:": "在地表，他猎杀哈尔西恩放出来的东西。科瓦想同时当所有野兽；芬恩觉得一头狼就够了。能嚎过他的只有布兰。当群狼嚎余音散尽：",
  "Born on Vharra, a Warden of the Standing Stones. Torn through; woke in Shaft Nine.": "生于瓦拉，立石守卫。被卷入裂隙；醒在九号竖井。",
  "The Hidden village's gentle giant": "隐秘村落的温柔巨人",
  "A huge bald man with a bronze jaw plate, carved stone gauntlets and a harness of rock, and the head of a stone dragon rising over his shoulder.": "一个魁梧的光头男人，下颌嵌着青铜护板，戴着雕石护手，身挂岩石挽具，一颗石龙的头从他肩后探起。",
  "Brakk was a Warden of the Standing Stones, the one the children followed because his shadow was cool in summer. The tear dropped him in Shaft Nine, Halcyon's deepest mine, where they put a drill in his hands and told him to dig. He dug. Upward. Through four hundred metres of rock, until he came out on the Surface under a grey sky.": "布拉克曾是立石守卫，孩子们总爱跟着他，因为夏天他的影子很凉快。裂隙把他扔进了九号竖井，哈尔西恩最深的矿井。他们往他手里塞了一台钻机，叫他挖。他挖了。往上挖。穿过400米岩层，直到在灰色的天空下钻出地表。",
  "Slow to anger, slower to stop: Boulder Toss, a Quake that runs both ways, an Earth Dragon that ploughs forward, a Warden's Wall of bedrock. Old Hollis found him sitting on the mountain, sat down beside him, and taught him that a mountain can choose where it stands.": "不轻易发怒，更不轻易停手：巨石投掷，向两边同时蔓延的震地，犁地而行的地龙，以基岩筑成的守望之墙。老霍利斯发现他坐在山上，便在他身旁坐下，教会了他：一座山可以选择自己立在哪里。",
  "Taro wants to know which of them is harder to move; Brakk is happy to let him lose. Opal, whose crystals frighten everyone, rides on his shoulder when she is scared. When World Breaker cracks the ground open:": "太郎想知道两人谁更难被推动；布拉克很乐意让他输。欧泊的水晶人人都怕，可她害怕的时候，就坐在他的肩上。当碎界将大地劈开：",
  "Born on Vharra's steppe, raised at a card table. Torn through.": "生于瓦拉草原，长在牌桌边。被卷入裂隙。",
  "Keeper of the Long Bar at Mile Zero": "零英里长吧台的掌柜",
  "Grey stubble under a wide-brimmed brown hat, a rust-red poncho over a dark shirt, and a six-shot revolver raised beside his face, still smoking.": "宽檐棕帽下是灰白的胡茬，深色衬衫外罩一件锈红色斗篷，一把六发左轮举在脸旁，枪口还冒着烟。",
  "Jax keeps the Long Bar at Mile Zero, the last stop before the open wastes, where every road on the Surface starts and most of them end. He came through the tear with a revolver, a deck of cards and the memory of his grandmother laughing as she dealt him in.": "杰克斯经营着零英里的长吧台。那是踏入茫茫荒原前的最后一站，地表上每条路都从这里出发，大多数也在这里到头。他穿过裂隙时，带着一把左轮、一副纸牌，还有祖母笑着给他发牌的记忆。",
  "Five to make a point, the sixth to end the conversation: Quick Shot, a Trick Shot that banks off four walls, Fan the Hammer, a Lucky Coin that sends five bullets hunting, and every sixth shot a Dead-Eye. Dyna says he is just a bomb with a slower fuse. Yara out-shoots him at a mile; he out-shoots her at ten paces.": "五发表明态度，第六发结束对话：速射，在四面墙间来回反弹的花式枪，扇锤连射，放出5颗子弹追猎的幸运硬币，外加每第六发必出的神射。黛娜说他不过是引线长一点的炸弹。隔着一英里，雅拉的枪法胜过他；隔着10步，他胜过雅拉。",
  "Zara dealt at his table once, before the Skylift and the money. Neither talks about how that ended. Tarn starts every run from his porch. At High Noon, every enemy is marked and the bell tolls six times:": "扎拉曾在他的牌桌上发牌，那是在天梯和钱财之前。那段往事如何收场，两人都绝口不提。塔恩每趟邮路都从他的门廊起跑。正午对决之时，所有敌人都被标记，钟声敲响6下：",
  "Born on Vharra's steppe, a message runner. Torn through.": "生于瓦拉草原，徒步送信的信使。被卷入裂隙。",
  "Runner of the Surface post": "地表邮路的信使",
  "A lean runner in a royal blue headband and a sleeveless running vest, forearms wrapped white, one knee raised high, blue streaks behind him.": "一个精瘦的跑者，头系宝蓝色头带，身穿无袖跑步背心，前臂缠着白布，一边膝盖高高抬起，身后拖着几道蓝色残影。",
  "The steppe of Vharra, end to end, is forty days on a good horse. Tarn did it on foot in nineteen with a message in his shirt. When the sky tore and the tear moved east at a walking pace, he walked in front of it for nine hundred miles, shouting at every camp to run. At the edge of the steppe there was no more east. He turned and hit it.": "瓦拉草原从这头到那头，骑一匹好马要走40天。塔恩把信揣在衣服里，徒步19天就跑完了。天空裂开那天，裂隙以步行的速度向东推进，他便走在它前面，走了900英里，冲沿途每座营地大喊快跑。到了草原尽头，再也没有东边可去。他转过身，一拳打了上去。",
  "Every hit lands harder than the last, for as long as he keeps hitting: Step Kick, Rising Knee, Hundred Paces, Thousand Miles. On the Surface he runs the post between the scattered towns, from Mile Zero to the Crater rim. He and Gale have raced eleven times. Ivo trains before dawn to keep up; Tarn has never told him he trains at night.": "每一击都比上一击更重，只要他不停手：踏步踢、飞膝、百步、千里行。在地表，他在零散的城镇间跑邮路，从零英里一直跑到陨坑边缘。他和盖尔赛跑过11次。伊沃天不亮就起来训练，为的是跟上他；塔恩从没告诉他，自己是在夜里练的。",
  "Fenn knew him on the steppe. Jax keeps his water cold. When everything he has ever walked lands in one punch, he jogs on the spot:": "芬恩在草原上就认识他。杰克斯总给他留着凉水。当他这辈子走过的每一步都汇进一拳，他原地小跑起来：",
  "Born in the far north of Vharra, in a long-house under the snow. Torn through.": "生于瓦拉极北之地，雪下的一座长屋里。被卷入裂隙。",
  "Hermit of the northern rim": "北缘隐士",
  "A huge bearded man in a fur-collared coat with a dark red sash, both fists raised, breath steaming, frost on his shoulders.": "一个高大的大胡子男人，穿着毛领大衣，系着暗红腰带，双拳高举，呼出白气，肩上结着霜。",
  "In the north of Vharra there were bears that walked like men, and men who fought like bears. Brann is the last of either. He woke in Halcyon's Ice House and broke out by walking through the wall. Now he lives on the cold northern rim of the Surface, where nobody goes and nobody bothers him.": "瓦拉的北方，曾有走路像人的熊，也有打架像熊的人。无论哪一种，如今都只剩布兰一个。他在哈尔西恩的冰窖里醒来，径直穿墙走了出去。如今他住在地表寒冷的北缘，那里没人去，也没人打扰他。",
  "Hurt him, and find out why nobody does it twice: Maul, a Roar that knocks shots out of the air, a Landslide charge, a Bear Hug that squeezes three times. Kova followed him for a month begging to learn the bear; Brann said yes, on condition the boy stopped talking. Isolde says winter answers to her. Brann has invited her north to say that.": "伤他一次，你就知道为什么没人敢来第二次：重殴，能把飞弹从半空震落的咆哮，山崩冲锋，连挤三下的熊抱。科瓦跟了他一个月，求他教自己熊的路数；布兰答应了，条件是这小子别再说话。伊索德说寒冬听她号令。布兰请她到北边来，当面再说一遍。",
  "Fenn is the only man he lets hunt beside him. At home the children shouted his short name, and not because they were afraid. When the Last Winter falls four times:": "芬恩是唯一一个他允许在身旁一起打猎的人。在家乡，孩子们总是大喊他的小名，而且不是因为害怕。当最后的寒冬四度降临：",
  "Surface-born, or Surface itself. Nobody is sure.": "生于地表，或者她就是地表本身。没人说得准。",
  "Guardian of the Buried Meridian": "被掩埋的子午线之守护者",
  "A tall, broad woman in a hooded sand-coloured cloak and veil, pale gold eyes glowing, thick ropes of sand streaming round her arms.": "一个高大宽阔的女人，披着沙色兜帽斗篷，蒙着面纱，淡金色的眼睛发着光，粗如绳索的沙流绕着她的双臂翻涌。",
  "Under the eastern dunes lies the Buried Meridian, a city that went down in the Ashfall War with its people still in it. Dune is its guardian. Some say she was one of them. Some say she is the sand they are buried in, standing up. She does not correct either.": "东部沙丘之下，埋着被掩埋的子午线，一座在落灰战争中连人带城一起沉没的城市。杜恩是它的守护者。有人说她曾是城中的一员。也有人说，她就是掩埋他们的那片沙，自己站了起来。两种说法，她都不纠正。",
  "Slow to start, slower to stop, and every hit she takes adds a layer of sand: Sand Lance, a Dune Grip that holds and squeezes, Sinking Sands, a Sand Maw that swallows. For years she fought Tarek's chain raiders, who dug the buried city for scrap to sell to Halcyon. Then Halcyon sent drills instead of buyers, and the two of them found they had the same enemy.": "起势慢，收势更慢，每挨一击，身上便多覆一层沙：沙枪，抓住便不放、越收越紧的沙丘之握，流沙，吞下一切的沙之巨口。多年来，她一直与塔里克的锁链掠夺者交战，那伙人在被埋的城里挖废料，卖给哈尔西恩。后来哈尔西恩送来的不再是买家，而是钻机，两人这才发现彼此的敌人是同一个。",
  "Opal's arrival from the Beyond turned half her desert into the Glass Sea, and Dune has not forgiven the glass. Hollis walks out to sit with her on the longest night of every year. When the Buried City rises over everyone and comes down:": "欧泊从彼岸到来时，把她半片沙漠变成了玻璃之海，杜恩至今没有原谅那些玻璃。每年最长的那一夜，霍利斯都会走进沙漠陪她坐着。当沙埋之城在众人头顶升起，又轰然落下：",
  "Surface-born, old enough to remember the Ashfall War.": "生于地表，年纪大到还记得落灰战争。",
  "Elder of the Hidden Clans, keeper of the Pact": "隐秘氏族长老，盟约的守护者",
  "An old, heavy-set hermit with a long white beard and a moss-green headband, a dark green robe with a stone-grey sash, small rocks floating round his open palm.": "一位年迈敦实的隐士，留着长长的白胡子，头系苔绿色头带，身穿深绿长袍，腰束石灰色腰带，摊开的掌心周围浮着几块小石头。",
  "Hollis remembers the night after the Ashfall War, when the rich went up and the poor went down and a handful of families swore to live in all three layers at once. He wrote the Pact of the Hidden Clans by firelight while a young monk called Oda rang a bell over it. He has kept the Clans' mountain village ever since.": "霍利斯记得落灰战争后的那一夜：富人上了天，穷人下了地，还有寥寥几户人家立誓同时活在三层世界里。他就着火光写下隐秘氏族的盟约，一个名叫奥达的年轻僧人在一旁为它敲响了钟。从那以后，他一直守着氏族的山中村落。",
  "Moves like a mountain, hits like one: Mountain Palm, Mudslick, an Old Shell that calls a stone tortoise down, Boulder Fall, Stone Garden. Standing still gathers Stillness, and Hollis has stood still longer than anyone alive. He taught Brakk to choose where a mountain stands, and Ivo to wait for the dawn.": "动如山岳，击亦如山：山岳掌、泥沼、召下一只石龟的古龟、巨石坠、石之庭。站着不动便能积攒静止，而霍利斯站着不动的时间比任何活人都长。他教会布拉克选择山立在哪里，也教会伊沃等待黎明。",
  "He walks into the desert to sit with Dune on the longest night. He and Oda still argue about the second line of the Pact. When the Elder Mountain stamps three times, he pats the nearest head:": "每到最长的那一夜，他便走进沙漠，陪杜恩坐着。他和奥达至今还在为盟约的第二句争个不休。当远古山灵三度踏地，他拍拍离他最近的那颗脑袋：",
  "Surface-born, in the Glowwild.": "生于地表的荧野。",
  "Gardener of the Glowwild": "荧野的园丁",
  "Bright green hair in a bun with a violet flower pinned in it, a dark green gardener's jacket, flowers opening in her palm and a soft cloud of glowing spores.": "一头亮绿色的头发挽成发髻，别着一朵紫花，身穿深绿色园丁外套，掌心有花朵绽开，周身飘着一团柔和的发光孢子。",
  "Everything Halcyon dumps ends up east, in the Glowwild, a forest that glows because it is poisoned. Ume grew up there, and decided that if the forest was going to be poison, it was going to be beautiful poison. Her garden is the loveliest thing on the Surface. Do not touch any of it.": "哈尔西恩倾倒的一切，最后都流向东边的荧野，一片因为中了毒才发光的森林。梅在那里长大，并且打定主意：既然这片林子注定是毒，那就得是美丽的毒。她的花园是地表上最可爱的东西。一样都别碰。",
  "Spore Puff drifts and stacks Blight, Vine Snap lifts, Bloom Field plants three surprises, a Corpse Flower snaps shut three times. When a starving swarm of bees came through the Beyond, Ume let them feed when nobody else would; their honey is now the only safe sweet thing in the Glowwild. Elixa buys her spores. Ume checks what for.": "孢子云缓缓飘散，叠加枯萎；藤鞭把人挑起；花田种下三份惊喜；尸花连咬三下。一群饥饿的蜜蜂穿过彼岸而来时，别人都不肯理会，只有梅让它们吃饱；如今它们的蜂蜜是荧野里唯一安全的甜东西。艾莉克莎向她买孢子。梅总要查查她拿去做什么。",
  "Thorne, who keeps a garden of bone under Deepline, sends her cuttings every spring with a polite note. She sends back something that blooms in his catacomb and makes him sneeze for a week. When Last Spring opens across the whole floor:": "索恩在深线之下照料着一座骸骨之园，每年春天都给她寄来插枝，附上一张客气的便条。她回寄的东西会在他的墓穴里开花，让他连打一个星期的喷嚏。当最后的春天在整片地面上绽开：",
  "Surface-born, found as a small boy in the Glowwild.": "生于地表，幼时在荧野被人发现。",
  "Wild child of the Glowwild": "荧野的野孩子",
  "Shaggy red-orange hair, tiger-stripe tattoos, an eagle feather and a turtle-shell pendant, and the spirit shapes of a tiger, an eagle and a tortoise behind him.": "一头蓬乱的橙红头发，身上是虎纹刺青，挂着一根鹰羽和一枚龟甲吊坠，身后浮现着虎、鹰、龟三道灵影。",
  "Kova was found in the Glowwild as a small boy and raised by whatever would have him: a tiger in the morning, an eagle by noon, a tortoise by night. He never learned to be only one thing. Each skill changes his form: the tiger hits harder, the eagle moves faster, the tortoise wears a shell nothing gets through.": "科瓦幼时在荧野被人发现，谁肯收留他，他就跟着谁长大：清晨是虎，正午是鹰，入夜是龟。他从没学会只做一种东西。每个技能都会改变他的形态：虎打得更狠，鹰跑得更快，龟背着一副什么都穿不透的壳。",
  "Tiger Pounce, Eagle Dive, Tortoise Shell, and all Three Beasts at once. The one beast he could never catch was the bear, so he followed Brann north for a month until the old man agreed to teach him. Fenn calls him a show-off; Kova calls Fenn a one-trick wolf. They hunt together anyway, and both pretend not to enjoy it.": "猛虎扑、鹰击、龟壳，还有三兽齐出。他唯一没能抓住的野兽是熊，于是他跟着布兰往北走了一个月，直到那老头答应教他。芬恩说他爱出风头；科瓦说芬恩是只只会一招的狼。他们照样一起打猎，还都假装不喜欢。",
  "Hart guards the caravans that pass the Glowwild, and Kova guards Hart, though Hart has not noticed. When the Primal Parade rolls through as every beast at once:": "哈特护送途经荧野的商队，科瓦则护着哈特，只是哈特还没发觉。当原始游行化作万兽齐奔，滚滚碾过：",
  "Surface-born, at Mile Zero.": "生于地表的零英里。",
  "Caravan guard of the long road": "长路上的商队护卫",
  "A calm young man in a green cap with a red band and a dark green coat, holding a very long spear on the diagonal, its tip glinting.": "一个沉稳的年轻人，戴着系红带的绿帽，穿深绿外套，斜握一杆极长的枪，枪尖闪着寒光。",
  "Hart guards the caravans that cross the Surface from Mile Zero to the Crater rim, and he has one rule: keep your distance. He will keep it for you. When an enemy steps into his reach while he is not attacking, the spear thrusts by itself. He has not been surprised in nine years.": "哈特护送商队横穿地表，从零英里到陨坑边缘，他只有一条规矩：保持距离。他会替你保持。他不出招的时候，只要有敌人踏进他的攻击范围，长枪就会自己刺出去。9年来，从没有什么让他措手不及。",
  "Long Thrust, a Pole Vault over the enemy, Hundred Thrusts, Skewer Rush, a Spear Throw that comes back. Yara argues that a bow reaches further. Hart argues that a bow has never stopped a charge. Tor, the shield at the head of every caravan, stopped arguing with either of them years ago.": "长刺，越过敌人头顶的撑杆跳，百刺，贯穿冲锋，还有会飞回来的掷枪。雅拉说弓射得更远。哈特说弓从来没挡住过一次冲锋。托尔是走在每支商队最前头的那面盾，他多年前就不跟这两人争了。",
  "Something follows his caravans through the Glowwild, and Hart leaves meat out for it without asking what it is. When A Thousand Spears rain down and one goes through everyone:": "有个东西一路尾随他的商队穿过荧野，哈特给它留肉，从不问那是什么。当千枪如雨落下，其中一杆贯穿所有人：",
  "Surface-born, in the Hidden village.": "生于地表的隐秘村落。",
  "Champion of the village ring": "村中土俵的王者",
  "A huge sumo wrestler with a black topknot and a golden belt, crouched with one leg raised, salt flying from his hand.": "一个魁梧的相扑力士，梳着黑色发髻，系着金色腰带，弓身抬起一条腿，手中撒出一把盐。",
  "In the Hidden Clans' mountain village there is a ring of packed earth, and in the ring there is Taro. He has stood in it since he was nine. In all that time nobody has pushed him out. Brakk came closest, and Brakk is a mountain.": "隐秘氏族的山中村落里有一座夯土的土俵，土俵里站着太郎。他从9岁起就站在那里。这么多年，没有一个人能把他推出去。布拉克离成功最近，而布拉克是一座山。",
  "You can push him. He would rather you did not. Palm Push walks forward, Grab and Throw goes through any guard, Shiko Stomp makes the floor jump, Belly Slam lands on you and Salt Toss leaves you blinking. Ivo spars with him every morning. Tor has been asking for years to settle which of them is the true wall.": "你可以推他。但他更希望你别推。突张步步向前，抓摔无视任何防御，四股踏让地面跳起来，肚压直接砸在你身上，撒盐让你眼睛直眨。伊沃每天早上都和他对练。托尔好几年来一直嚷着要分个高下，看谁才是真正的墙。",
  "Oda blesses his ring with the bell every spring. Taro bows to the bell, and to his opponents, and then to the floor they are lying on:": "每年春天，奥达都会敲钟为他的土俵祈福。太郎向钟鞠躬，向对手鞠躬，再向对手躺着的地面鞠躬：",
  "Surface-born, in the eastern wastes.": "生于地表的东部荒原。",
  "Chief of the chain raiders": "锁链掠夺者首领",
  "A rangy man in a grey bandana and a brown leather vest with brass buckles, a short sickle in one hand and a long iron chain with a brass weight looping from the other.": "一个手长腿长的男人，裹着灰色头巾，穿着带黄铜扣的棕色皮背心，一手握短镰，另一手垂下一条盘绕的长铁链，末端坠着黄铜锤。",
  "Tarek led the chain raiders of the eastern wastes: diggers, salvagers and thieves who hauled scrap out of the Buried Meridian and sold it to whoever was buying, usually Halcyon. He never has to come to you. You always come to him: Chain Lash reels you in, Hook Pull yanks you to his feet, Iron Cyclone clears a circle.": "塔里克曾率领东部荒原的锁链掠夺者，一伙挖掘工、拾荒者和小偷，他们从被掩埋的子午线里拖出废料，谁出价就卖给谁，通常是哈尔西恩。他从来不必走向你。永远是你走向他：链击把你卷过来，钩拉把你拽到他脚边，铁旋风清出一圈空地。",
  "For years his raiders and Dune's sand fought over the buried city, and he lost more chains than he can count. Then Halcyon sent drills instead of buyers, and Tarek understood who would be buried next. He walked into the desert unarmed and offered Dune his chain. She took it. They still do not like each other.": "多年来，他的掠夺者和杜恩的沙为那座被埋的城争斗不休，他丢掉的锁链多得数不清。后来哈尔西恩送来的不再是买家，而是钻机，塔里克明白了下一个被埋的会是谁。他空着手走进沙漠，把自己的锁链递给杜恩。她收下了。两人至今仍互看不顺眼。",
  "Garo forged his sickle and keeps it sharp. Bando of Deepline claims a longer reach, in public. When the Chain Prison locks shut on everyone:": "他的镰刀是加罗打的，也一直由加罗磨得锋利。深线的班多当众宣称自己的攻击距离更长。当锁链牢笼将所有人锁死：",
  "Surface-born. Rang the bell over the Pact ninety-six years ago.": "生于地表。96年前，为盟约敲响了钟。",
  "Monk of the Temple of the Last Toll": "终钟寺的僧人",
  "A broad, calm bald monk in an ochre robe, a small bronze temple bell hanging from a rope in one big hand, rings of sound rippling from it.": "一位宽肩沉静的光头僧人，身穿赭色僧袍，一只大手提着绳子，绳下悬着一口青铜小寺钟，一圈圈声波从钟上荡开。",
  "Oda is a monk who took a vow of silence. The bell did not. He keeps the Temple of the Last Toll at the edge of the Hidden village, and the bell has rung there every dawn since he and Hollis made the Pact beneath it.": "奥达是一位立过禁语誓的僧人。钟可没立过。他守着隐秘村落边上的终钟寺；自从他和霍利斯在那口钟下立下盟约，每天黎明钟声都会响起。",
  "Toll Wave rolls out and grows; Bell Drop traps the nearest enemy and rings; Resonance strikes the floor three times; and a perfect block rings his own bell and resets everything. A small girl called Coda used to count the tolls with her feet. Oda watched a masked man take her up to the sky, and he has rung a little harder every morning since.": "钟波向外滚荡，越扩越大；落钟困住最近的敌人，随即鸣响；共鸣连击地面三下；而一次完美格挡会敲响他自己的钟，让一切重置。曾有个叫寇妲的小女孩，总用脚步数着钟声。奥达眼看着一个戴面具的男人把她带上了天空，从那以后，他每天早上都敲得更用力一些。",
  "He blesses Taro's ring every spring. He and Hollis still argue about the Pact, which is impressive, since only one of them speaks. When the Last Toll hangs over the arena, the bell says it for him:": "每年春天，他都为太郎的土俵祈福。他和霍利斯至今还在为盟约争论，这很了不起，毕竟两人之中只有一个会开口。当最后的钟声笼罩竞技场，钟替他说出那句话：",
  "Smith and gatekeeper of the Hidden village": "隐秘村落的铁匠兼守门人",
  "A huge armoured man in a dark steel helmet and grey plate, holding up a four-bladed shuriken as wide as his chest, sparks glancing off its edge.": "一个披甲的魁梧男人，戴着深色钢盔，身着灰色板甲，高举一枚与胸同宽的四刃手里剑，刃口迸着火星。",
  "Garo is the smith of the Hidden village and the keeper of its gate. He forged his shuriken from a Halcyon drill bit the width of a door, and he throws it once and it hits you twice: Wheel Throw, Iron Guard, Grind Wheel, Meteor Wheel, Twin Wheels.": "加罗是隐秘村落的铁匠，也是村门的守门人。他用一枚门板那么宽的哈尔西恩钻头打出了这枚手里剑，扔出去一次，能打中你两次：掷轮、铁壁、碾轮、流星轮、双轮。",
  "The best steel on the Surface comes up from Deepline, through tunnels no Halcyon map shows. Ferra sends it; Garo sends back food. Neither has ever seen the other's face, and each would die for the other. That is what the Pact was for.": "地表最好的钢来自深线，经由哈尔西恩任何地图上都没有的隧道运上来。费拉送钢上来，加罗送粮下去。两人从未见过对方的脸，却都愿为对方而死。盟约，就是为此而立的。",
  "He forged Tarek's sickle and Tor's shield, and he and Tor hold the gate together: one throws, one catches. When A Thousand Wheels cross the arena and one the size of a house comes down:": "塔里克的镰刀和托尔的盾都是他打的，他和托尔一同守门：一个扔，一个接。当千轮横扫竞技场，一枚房子那么大的轮子轰然落下：",
  "Surface-born, in a dust town below the mountain.": "生于地表，山脚下的一座尘土小镇。",
  "Hollis's student, up before dawn": "霍利斯的弟子，天不亮就起",
  "A muscular martial artist with a black mohawk, a sleeveless black top, gold trousers and gold-wrapped fists, golden steam rising off his shoulders.": "一个肌肉结实的武者，留着黑色莫西干头，穿黑色无袖上衣和金色长裤，双拳缠着金色绑带，金色蒸汽从他肩头升腾。",
  "Ivo trains every morning before dawn. It shows. He climbed to the Hidden village at fourteen and asked Hollis to teach him; Hollis told him to wait for the sunrise. He waited a year of sunrises, and then he was taught.": "伊沃每天天不亮就开始训练。看得出来。14岁那年，他爬上隐秘村落，请霍利斯收他为徒；霍利斯叫他等日出。他等了整整一年的日出，然后才开始学艺。",
  "Every combo hit he lands takes time off his skills, so he simply never stops: Whirl Heel, Sky Kick, a Fist Storm of twelve punches in two seconds, Meteor Heel. Tarn runs the roads for a living, and Ivo means to catch him on foot. Lin of the Sky Clan calls his style loud. She has sealed him twice. He is working on it.": "他每打中一记连击，技能冷却就缩短一些，所以他干脆从不停手：旋踵、冲天踢、2秒内打出12拳的拳风暴、流星踵。塔恩靠跑路谋生，伊沃一心要徒步追上他。天空氏族的琳说他的路数太吵。她已经封住过他两次。他正在想办法。",
  "Taro spars with him every morning and has never once been moved. When the Seventh Breath lands from every side at once:": "太郎每天早上都和他对练，从没被推动过一次。当第七息从四面八方同时落下：",
  "The gate's shield, and the caravans'": "村门之盾，亦是商队之盾",
  "A tall, broad man in a steel-blue helmet and plate, a huge round shield held in front with arrows and shards bouncing off it.": "一个高大宽厚的男人，头戴钢蓝色头盔，身披同色板甲，身前举着一面巨大的圆盾，箭矢和碎片纷纷从盾上弹开。",
  "Nothing has ever got past Tor. Nothing is about to start now. He holds the gate of the Hidden village beside Garo, he walks at the head of Hart's caravans, and arrows simply bounce.": "从来没有东西能越过托尔。现在也不会有。他与加罗并肩守着隐秘村落的大门，走在哈特商队的最前头，箭矢射来，只会弹开。",
  "Shield Toss, Shield Bash, Bulwark Slam, a Phalanx that sends every shot back, Unbreakable. Garo forged the shield; Tor has never once dropped it. He has heard that in Aurelia there is a knight called Aldric who holds a line just as well, and he would like to see that for himself.": "掷盾、盾击、堡垒重击、把所有飞弹原样奉还的方阵、坚不可摧。盾是加罗打的；托尔从没让它脱过手。他听说奥蕾莉亚有个叫奥德瑞的骑士，守起防线来一样滴水不漏，他很想亲眼见识一下。",
  "Taro thinks he is the immovable one. Brakk thinks they are both very loud. When the Last Stand rolls out wall after wall through everyone, he plants his feet:": "太郎觉得自己才是岿然不动的那一个。布拉克觉得他俩都吵得要命。当背水一战一道接一道地推出墙壁、碾过所有人，他站稳了脚跟：",
  "Born on Vharra, under the thunderheads. Torn through; woke in a Deepline trash heap.": "生于瓦拉，雷雨云之下。被卷入裂隙，在深线的垃圾堆里醒来。",
  "Street kid of the Crusher Yard": "粉碎场的街头小子",
  "Shaggy white hair under a cyan headband, a long red scarf, a sleeveless slate-blue scrap jacket and bandaged forearms, amber lightning crackling round his fists.": "一头蓬乱的白发压在青色头带下，一条长长的红围巾，一件石板蓝的无袖拼布夹克，前臂缠着绷带，琥珀色的闪电在双拳周围噼啪作响。",
  "The tear dropped him in the Crusher Yard trash heap with static in his hair and a stubbornness nobody could explain. Ferra found him under a car door and decided he was salvage. The slum kids called him Sparks. Rook called him brother by the end of the first week.": "裂隙把他扔进了粉碎场的垃圾堆，头发里噼啪带电，还有一股谁也说不清的倔劲。费拉在一扇车门底下发现了他，认定他是件值得回收的废品。贫民窟的孩子们叫他火花。还没过完第一周，鲁克就管他叫兄弟了。",
  "Spark Dart, Thunder Totem, a Breaker Rush through walls and a Magnet Grip up them. A hunter in a wolf-pelt hood saw the storm-eye of Vharra scratched on his jacket and knew a child of the storm clans when he saw one. Fenn has looked after him ever since. Sable of the Lantern Cell thinks one Deepliner with lightning is plenty.": "电光镖，雷霆图腾，用破击突进撞穿墙壁，再用磁力擒拿爬上墙去。一个戴狼皮兜帽的猎人看见他夹克上刻着的瓦拉风暴之眼，一眼认出这是风暴部族的孩子。从那以后，芬恩一直照看着他。灯笼小队的萨布尔觉得，深线有一个会放闪电的人就够了。",
  "Halcyon told him an escaped Subject called Nyra had sold out the tunnels. He believed it, for one fight. The Director dropped him in the trash and called it an accident; Kael climbed out. When Skyfall hammers every enemy on the screen:": "哈尔西恩告诉他，一个叫妮拉的逃亡实验体出卖了地道里的人。他信了，信了一场架那么久。总监把他扔进垃圾堆，说是意外；凯尔自己爬了出来。当天坠砸向屏幕上的每一个敌人：",
  "Born by the Frozen Harbour, tender of the deep vents. Torn through; chained in the Core Sump.": "生于冰封港湾畔，深层热泉的照料人。被卷入裂隙，锁在核心污水坑里。",
  "Halcyon Subject 60, the furnace's prisoner": "哈尔西恩60号实验体，熔炉的囚徒",
  "A powerful woman in black obsidian armour cracked with glowing lava veins, short black hair, molten rock dripping from her clenched gauntlet.": "一个身形强健的女人，身披黑曜石铠甲，裂纹间流淌着发光的熔岩，黑色短发，紧握的铁手套中滴落着熔融的岩石。",
  "At home there were deep vents under the harbour, red and warm and patient, and Ashka was the one who tended them. Halcyon put her in the Core Sump, the furnace at the bottom of everything that burns Aurelia's waste and heats Deepline from below. Subject 60. For a year, half of Deepline was warm because she was in pain.": "在故乡，港湾底下有深层热泉，赤红、温暖、耐心，而阿什卡就是照料它们的人。哈尔西恩把她关进了核心污水坑——那座位于万物最底层的熔炉，焚烧奥蕾莉亚的废料，从下方温暖着深线。60号实验体。整整一年，半个深线的温暖，都来自她的痛苦。",
  "The floor is never safe near her: Magma Glob, Lava Geyser, a Molten Wave, a Caldera that breaks out on both sides. Fumi, who runs the boilers above the Sump, heard her through the pipes and tapped back every night. When Pyra burned the Burn Ward, the fire ran down the vents to the Sump, and the two of them met inside it.": "她身边的地面从来不安全：岩浆弹，熔岩喷泉，一道熔浪，一座向两侧同时爆发的火山口。在污水坑上方管锅炉的芙美，隔着管道听见了她，每晚都敲着管道回应。派拉烧掉烧伤病房时，火顺着通风管一路烧进污水坑，她们俩就在那片火里相遇了。",
  "They have been sisters since. Dyna blew the Sump's door off, and has been allowed to watch every eruption since. When the whole floor goes up at once:": "从那以后她们就是姐妹。黛娜炸飞了污水坑的门，从此获准观看每一次喷发。当整片地面同时爆起：",
  "Born on Vharra's steppe, the festival's fireworks girl. Torn through; woke in the Scrapworks.": "生于瓦拉草原，节庆上放烟花的女孩。被卷入裂隙，在废料工坊醒来。",
  "Demolition artist of the Scrapworks": "废料工坊的爆破艺术家",
  "A grinning young woman with messy blonde hair under a yellow cap and goggles, a patched olive jacket crossed with bandoliers of round black bombs, a lit one in her hand.": "一个咧嘴笑的年轻女人，凌乱的金发压在黄色帽子和护目镜下，打着补丁的橄榄色夹克上交叉挂着一串串圆形黑炸弹，手里还拿着一颗点着的。",
  "On Vharra, a girl with burnt eyebrows set a tube on the ground at the storm-season festival and the whole sky went gold. In Deepline she runs the Scrapworks, and every problem is a demolition job: Grenade, Proximity Mine, Rocket, and a Recoil Blast that throws her backwards across the room.": "在瓦拉的风暴季节庆上，一个眉毛烧焦的女孩把一根发射筒立在地上，整片天空都变成了金色。在深线，她掌管着废料工坊，每个问题都是一桩爆破活儿：手雷，感应地雷，火箭，还有一记把她自己往后掀飞、横穿整个房间的后坐冲击。",
  "Mako was her first customer and is now her partner: she makes the bombs, he carries them in a suit of armour that can take the blast. She blew the door off the Core Sump for Ashka. She blows a hole in something for Bando most weeks, usually on purpose.": "马科是她的第一个顾客，如今是她的搭档：她造炸弹，他穿着一套扛得住爆炸的装甲把炸弹带上。她为阿什卡炸飞了核心污水坑的门。差不多每周她都要替班多在什么东西上炸个洞，通常是故意的。",
  "Jax at the Long Bar says she has no sense of timing. She has offered to show him a fuse. When the Carpet Bomb finishes and the dust settles:": "长吧台的杰克斯说她毫无时机感。她提出给他看看引信。当地毯轰炸结束、尘埃落定：",
  "Born on Vharra's steppe. Torn through; woke on Dockside Nine.": "生于瓦拉草原。被卷入裂隙，在九号码头醒来。",
  "Dock hand of the Drowned Line": "溺亡线的码头工",
  "A lanky, grinning dock worker in a lime-green bandana and a teal work vest, forearms bandaged, one arm stretched impossibly long with the fist huge in front.": "一个瘦高个、咧嘴笑的码头工人，系着青柠绿头巾，穿着蓝绿色工装背心，前臂缠着绷带，一条胳膊伸得长得离谱，拳头在前方变得巨大。",
  "Festival day on the steppe: a hundred kites, and one tangled in the only tree for a mile. A lanky boy looked at it and did not climb. He reached. The whole camp went quiet, then laughed until it could not stop. The kite belonged to a little girl called Sora, and Bando will tell you about it whether you ask or not.": "草原上的节日：上百只风筝，有一只缠在了方圆一英里内唯一的树上。一个瘦高的男孩看了看，没有爬。他伸手去够。整个营地安静下来，接着笑得停不下来。那只风筝属于一个叫索拉的小女孩，不管你问没问，班多都会讲给你听。",
  "Now he works Dockside Nine, the last wharf of the Drowned Line, where everything is out of reach except to him: Long Jab, Slingshot, Wind-Up, Reel In, Rubber Cannon. Dyna blows holes in walls for him; he reaches through them.": "如今他在九号码头干活，那是溺亡线的最后一座码头，那里的一切都够不着——除了他：长刺拳，弹弓，蓄劲，回拉，橡皮炮。黛娜替他在墙上炸洞，他就把手从洞里伸过去。",
  "Tarek of the chain raiders claims a longer reach. Bando has invited him down to measure. Gale still owes him a kite. When the Hundred Hands come from every direction at once:": "锁链掠夺者的塔里克自称够得更远。班多已经邀他下来量一量。盖尔还欠他一只风筝。当百手从四面八方同时袭来：",
  "Born on Vharra's steppe, in a smithy. Torn through; woke in the Crusher Yard.": "生于瓦拉草原的一间铁匠铺。被卷入裂隙，在粉碎场醒来。",
  "Ruler of the Crusher Yard": "粉碎场之主",
  "A bright red mohawk, a steel-blue armoured jacket, one gauntlet red and one blue, and scrap metal and a saw blade orbiting her raised hand.": "鲜红的莫霍克发型，钢蓝色的装甲夹克，一只红色、一只蓝色的铁手套，废铁和一片锯片绕着她举起的手旋转。",
  "On the night Ferra was born, every tool on the smithy wall turned to face the cradle. In Deepline, every piece of junk answers to her. She rules the Crusher Yard, where everything Aurelia throws away comes to rest, and she decides what is worth saving. One night, that was a white-haired boy under a car door.": "费拉出生的那晚，铁匠铺墙上的每件工具都转向了摇篮。在深线，每一块破烂都听她的。她统治着粉碎场，奥蕾莉亚扔掉的一切最后都落在那里，值不值得留下，由她说了算。有一晚，值得留下的是车门底下一个白发男孩。",
  "Sawback, a Polarity that pulls and then pushes, a Scrap Halo, a Scrap Press, and a Junkyard Comet made of every loose piece of metal on the screen. Vex was her apprentice until he decided pull and push were the same thing and left to prove it. Mako's armour is built out of her scrap.": "锯背，先拉后推的极性，废铁光环，废铁压制，还有一颗由屏幕上每块松散金属汇成的废铁彗星。维克斯曾是她的学徒，直到他认定拉和推是一回事，便离开去证明这一点。马科的装甲就是用她的废铁造的。",
  "Through tunnels no map shows, she sends the best steel in Deepline up to a smith on the Surface called Garo. She has never seen his face. When the Junkyard Comet has come down:": "她通过任何地图上都没有的地道，把深线最好的钢送上去，交给地表一个叫加罗的铁匠。她从没见过他的脸。当废铁彗星落下之后：",
  "Born on Vharra's steppe, at an old school of the blade. Torn through.": "生于瓦拉草原，一所古老的剑术学堂。被卷入裂隙。",
  "Master of the Rust Dojo": "锈蚀道场的宗师",
  "A calm swordsman with a black topknot, a white robe and a pink sash, a hand resting on a sheathed curved sword, eyes half closed, petals drifting past.": "一位沉静的剑客，扎着黑色发髻，白袍粉腰带，一只手搭在入鞘的弯刀上，双眼半闭，花瓣从身旁飘过。",
  "In an old school on the steppe, a teacher gave him a square of white paper and asked for one line of ink. Sen waited so long she sat down. In autumn she threw leaves into the wind and told him to cut one; he cut the one about to land on her head, and she gave him her sword.": "在草原上的一所旧学堂里，一位老师给了他一方白纸，要他落一道墨。森恩等了太久，她只好坐下。秋天，她把落叶抛进风里，叫他砍中一片；他砍中了正要落在她头上的那一片，于是她把自己的剑给了他。",
  "The tear dropped him in Deepline, and he made a dojo out of a rusted metro car: the cleanest room underground. Stand still a moment, then be done: Draw, Falling Leaf, Three Breaths, After the Bell. When Pell betrayed the Lantern Cell, Sable came to the Rust Dojo and asked to learn the Flash Step properly. Sen said nothing for a week. Then he taught her.": "裂隙把他扔进了深线，他用一节生锈的地铁车厢建了一座道场：地底下最干净的屋子。静立片刻，然后便已结束：拔刀，落叶，三息，钟声之后。佩尔背叛灯笼小队后，萨布尔来到锈蚀道场，请求正正经经地学会闪步。森恩一个星期没说话。然后他教了她。",
  "Isa, who drew lines beside him at that school, writes to him from the Archive. Noct is the only blade he has met that he could not see, and he means to see it once. When the Single Stroke arrives all at once:": "伊莎当年在那所学堂里和他并肩练笔，如今从档案馆给他写信。诺克特是他遇过的唯一一把看不见的剑，他打算看清一次。当一笔斩一瞬间全部落下：",
  "Deepline-born, in the slums.": "生于深线贫民窟。",
  "Hidden Clans, the Lantern Cell": "隐秘氏族，灯笼小队",
  "Spiky dark teal hair under a charcoal headband with a small steel plate, a teal wrap jacket, a grin, and two see-through copies of himself stepping out behind him.": "一头深蓝绿色的刺猬头，压在嵌着小钢片的炭灰色头带下，蓝绿色交领外衣，咧着嘴笑，身后走出两个半透明的自己。",
  "Rook never fights alone, not even when he is alone. Every skill leaves a clone that fights beside him: Twin Rush, Swap Out, Pile-On, Wheel Toss. He was the loudest of the Lantern Cell, three Deepline kids the Hidden Clans trained in secret, with Sable and Moro.": "鲁克从不单打独斗，哪怕他孤身一人。每个技能都会留下一个分身与他并肩作战：双影突袭，替身换位，群起而攻，旋轮抛掷。他是灯笼小队里嗓门最大的一个——那是隐秘氏族秘密训练的三个深线孩子，另外两个是萨布尔和莫罗。",
  "Their sensei was a smiling man in a porcelain mask called Pell, who taught them everything about strings except whose hand held his. When Pell sold the Cell to Halcyon, Rook's clones held the door until the last one went up in smoke, and Rook came out of the smoke behind it. He has not forgiven Pell. He has not forgotten that Pell taught him the clones.": "他们的老师是个戴瓷面具、总在微笑的男人，名叫佩尔。他教了他们关于丝线的一切，唯独没说牵着他自己丝线的是谁的手。佩尔把小队卖给哈尔西恩时，鲁克的分身死守着门，直到最后一个化作青烟，而鲁克从那团烟后走了出来。他没有原谅佩尔。他也没有忘记，分身是佩尔教的。",
  "Kael is his brother from the slums; Kiri, with her paper double, is the only one who really gets him. Rue copied his clones once, and for a week there were far too many Rooks. When A Thousand Rooks pile on:": "凯尔是他贫民窟里的兄弟；有个纸分身的基里，是唯一真正懂他的人。露曾经复制过他的分身，于是整整一周，鲁克多得不像话。当千人鲁克一拥而上：",
  "Deepline-born, under the Skylift's roots.": "生于深线，天梯的根部之下。",
  "Long black hair, a dark violet scarf pulled up over her nose and mouth, a dark indigo bodysuit, a reversed knife in one hand and violet lightning crackling round the other.": "一头黑色长发，深紫色围巾拉起遮住口鼻，一身深靛蓝紧身衣，一只手反握短刀，另一只手周围噼啪闪着紫色雷电。",
  "Quiet, until the air starts to hum. Then it is already over. Sable was the second of the Lantern Cell, the one who never spoke at lessons and always finished first. Spark Kunai, Flash Step, Thunder Pierce, Storm Call: every skill hit builds static, and the static has to go somewhere.": "安静，直到空气开始嗡鸣。那时一切已经结束了。萨布尔是灯笼小队的第二人，上课从不开口，却总是第一个完成。电光苦无，闪步，雷霆贯穿，唤雷：每次技能命中都会积蓄静电，而静电总得有个去处。",
  "When Pell betrayed the Cell, she ran with Moro while Rook held the door, and she has been running at Pell ever since. She learned the true Flash Step in Sen's Rust Dojo: a week of silence for one lesson. It was worth it.": "佩尔背叛小队时，她趁鲁克守住门口，和莫罗一起逃了，从那以后她一直在跑——朝着佩尔跑。她在森恩的锈蚀道场学会了真正的闪步：一周的沉默，换一堂课。值得。",
  "Then a kid from the trash heap started throwing lightning round the slums, loudly, and Sable decided Deepline had one thunder too many. Kael disagrees. They are working it out in public. When the Thunderhead strikes everyone, again and again, then all at once:": "后来，一个垃圾堆里出来的小子开始在贫民窟到处甩闪电，动静还很大，萨布尔便认定深线多了一道雷。凯尔不同意。他们正当着众人的面把这事掰扯清楚。当雷暴云一次又一次劈向所有人，最后一齐落下：",
  "Deepline-born, in the dark between the station lamps.": "生于深线，站台灯与站台灯之间的黑暗里。",
  "A tired-looking young man with a small black topknot and a dark slate jacket, hands held calm, long shadows reaching out from beneath him like hands.": "一个面带倦容的年轻人，扎着小小的黑色发髻，穿深石板灰夹克，双手沉静，长长的影子从他脚下伸出，像一只只手。",
  "He would rather not fight at all. He is very good at making it short. Moro was the third of the Lantern Cell, the one who fell asleep in lessons and still got the answers right. Shade Dart pins, Sink Step comes up behind you, Shadow Snare holds a whole room still.": "他宁愿根本不打。但他很擅长速战速决。莫罗是灯笼小队的第三人，上课总睡着，答案却照样全对。影镖将人钉住，沉影步从你背后冒出来，影缚让整间屋子一动不动。",
  "When the Cell was sold, he and Sable ran through the dark while Rook held the door. He has carried Rook's guilt as well as his own ever since, because Rook is too loud to notice he has any. Pell taught him that shadows hide things. He decided they should hold things instead.": "小队被出卖时，他和萨布尔趁鲁克守住门口，穿过黑暗逃走。从那以后，他背负着自己的愧疚，也背着鲁克的，因为鲁克太吵了，根本察觉不到自己也有。佩尔教他，影子能把东西藏起来。他决定，影子该用来把东西抓住。",
  "Vesper, the Subject who walks through shadows like doors, has been on his rooftops more than once. He finds it rude. When the Long Night puts the lights out over everyone:": "韦斯帕，那个把影子当门来穿的实验体，不止一次跑上他的屋顶。他觉得这很没礼貌。当长夜熄灭所有人头顶的灯光：",
  "Deepline-born. Nobody alive has seen his face.": "生于深线。活着的人里，没人见过他的脸。",
  "Hidden Clans sensei, and the Director's spymaster": "隐秘氏族的老师，总监的间谍头子",
  "A thin man in a white porcelain mask and a plum coat, glowing pink threads running from every fingertip to a wooden marionette with blades for arms.": "一个瘦削的男人，戴着白色瓷面具，穿梅紫色外套，发光的粉色丝线从每根指尖延伸出去，连着一具双臂是刀刃的木偶。",
  "He stands at the back and smiles. The thing in front of him does not. Pell was the Hidden Clans' teacher in Deepline, sensei of the Lantern Cell, and for ten years he was also the Director's spymaster. Nobody saw the strings until they were all pulled at once.": "他站在后面微笑。他前面那东西可不笑。佩尔是隐秘氏族派驻深线的教师，灯笼小队的老师，而整整十年，他同时也是总监的间谍头子。没人看见那些丝线，直到它们被一齐拉紧。",
  "Puppet Lunge, Venom Mist, an Iron Cradle that shuts on you, Hundred Strings, Cat's Cradle. He took a little girl called Coda from Oda's temple and made her the star of the Noble Ring. He found a creature with no face in Halcyon's Blank Wing and taught her to wear anyone's. He sold Rook, Sable and Moro to Halcyon for a key to the Engine.": "傀儡突刺，毒雾，一座会朝你合拢的铁摇篮，百丝，翻花绳。他从奥达的寺庙带走了一个叫寇妲的小女孩，让她成了贵族环区的明星。他在哈尔西恩的空白侧楼里找到一个没有脸的生物，教她戴上任何人的脸。他把鲁克、萨布尔和莫罗卖给了哈尔西恩，换来一把引擎的钥匙。",
  "He told himself he was keeping the layers in balance. The Director told him the same thing. When the Grand Theatre closes in on everyone, he takes a bow nobody asked for:": "他告诉自己，他是在维持各层之间的平衡。总监也是这么告诉他的。当大剧场向所有人合拢，他鞠了一个没人要的躬：",
  "Deepline-born, in the catacombs.": "生于深线的地下墓穴。",
  "Keeper of the catacombs": "地下墓穴的守护人",
  "A pale, gaunt man with long white braided hair and a dark maroon coat, a sword grown out of white bone, sharp spurs along his forearms.": "一个苍白消瘦的男人，白色长发编成辫子，穿深栗红色外套，手中一柄由白骨长成的剑，前臂上生着一排尖利的骨刺。",
  "Under the oldest part of Deepline lie the catacombs where the dead of the Ashfall War were laid, and Thorne keeps them as a garden. Everything he needs, he already carries inside: Finger Shards, a Spine Whip, a Bone Grove, a Marrow Lance. Anyone who hits him with a combo cuts themselves on him.": "深线最古老的地段之下，是安葬落灰战争死者的地下墓穴，索恩把它们当花园来打理。他需要的一切，早已带在身体里：指骨碎片，脊骨鞭，骨林，骨髓长枪。谁用连击打他，谁就会被他割伤。",
  "He is polite, patient and deeply unsettling. Vesna's Red Ledger keeps the debts of the living; Thorne keeps the debts of the dead, and between them they run the dark half of Deepline. Hex, the ghost girl from the Beyond, visits his garden because it is the only quiet place on the near side.": "他礼貌、耐心，又让人深深不安。维斯娜的赤色账簿记着活人的债；索恩记着死人的债，两人一起掌管着深线黑暗的那一半。来自彼岸的幽灵女孩赫克丝常来他的花园，因为那是此岸唯一安静的地方。",
  "Every spring he sends cuttings to Ume of the Glowwild, as one gardener to another. She sends back pollen. When the Ossuary closes its ribs over everyone:": "每年春天，他都会给荧野的梅寄去插枝，园丁致园丁。她回寄花粉。当骸骨堂在所有人头顶合拢肋骨：",
  "Deepline-born, in the Crusher Yard.": "生于深线的粉碎场。",
  "Owner of the yard across the tunnel": "隧道对面那座场子的主人",
  "A stocky young man in a charcoal jacket over steel-plated forearms, one fist glowing red and the other pale blue, iron scraps floating between his hands.": "一个敦实的年轻人，炭灰色夹克下是包着钢板的前臂，一只拳头泛着红光，另一只泛着淡蓝光，铁屑在两手之间漂浮。",
  "Opposites attract. He makes sure of it. Vex was Ferra's apprentice in the Crusher Yard until he worked out that pull and push are the same force pointed two ways, and decided he did not need a teacher who disagreed. He took his half of the scrap and set up across the tunnel.": "异极相吸。这一点由他来保证。维克斯曾是费拉在粉碎场的学徒，直到他想通了拉和推是同一种力朝两个方向使，便认定自己不需要一个不同意这一点的师父。他拿走自己那一半废铁，在隧道对面另起炉灶。",
  "Repel Shot throws you back, Attract drags you in, and the other charge within a breath snaps for more: Iron Storm, Lodestar, Flux Flip. To build his own yard he borrowed from Vesna's Red Ledger, and she has been collecting ever since.": "斥力弹把你推开，吸引把你拽近，一息之内换上相反的电荷，便会啪地一声打得更狠：钢铁风暴，磁极星，磁通反转。为了建自己的场子，他向维斯娜的赤色账簿借了钱，从那以后她一直在收账。",
  "Mako, whose magnets he tunes, is the only friend he kept from the Yard. Ferra pretends she does not watch his fights. When Magnetar throws everyone away and drags them back:": "他替马科调校磁铁，马科是他从粉碎场留下的唯一朋友。费拉假装没在看他打架。当磁星把所有人甩开，又拽回来：",
  "Deepline-born, in the Red Quarter.": "生于深线的赤区。",
  "Keeper of the Red Ledger": "赤色账簿的掌簿人",
  "A pale, elegant woman with dark crimson hair and a black and red coat, holding a scythe whose blade is liquid blood, drops floating upward round her.": "一个苍白优雅的女人，深绯红色头发，黑红相间的外套，手持一把刃身是流动鲜血的镰刀，血珠在她周身向上漂浮。",
  "Everything has a price. Vesna pays it in red, and collects in red. She keeps the Red Ledger, the book of every debt in Deepline, and nobody has ever paid her late twice. Her skills cost her own blood and heal her for every hit: Blood Needle, Crimson Step, the Blood Moon Scythe, Hemorrhage, Red Rain.": "万物皆有代价。维斯娜用红色支付，也用红色收账。她掌管着赤色账簿——深线每一笔债的总账，从没有人能第二次对她拖欠。她的技能要耗她自己的血，每次命中又为她回血：血针，赤红步，血月镰，大出血，血雨。",
  "Maren the Tide Doctor calls what she does a sickness. Vesna calls it bookkeeping. Thorne keeps the debts of the dead and she keeps the living's; they take tea together on Sundays. Vex owes her more than he will ever have.": "潮汐医生玛伦说她做的事是一种病。维斯娜管这叫记账。索恩记死人的债，她记活人的；他们每个星期天一起喝茶。维克斯欠她的，比他这辈子能有的还多。",
  "What nobody in Deepline knows is that the Red Ledger has one page for Halcyon, and it is the longest. Vesna means to collect. When the Crimson Eclipse turns the moon red:": "深线没人知道的是，赤色账簿里有一页是留给哈尔西恩的，而且是最长的一页。维斯娜打算把这笔账收回来。当赤红之蚀把月亮染红：",
  "Deepline-born, beside the boilers.": "生于深线，锅炉旁。",
  "Boilerman above the Core Sump": "核心污水坑上方的锅炉工",
  "A heavy-set man in a grey cloth mask and a grey work coat with brass valves on the shoulders, steam pouring from the valves and his clenched fists.": "一个身材壮实的男人，戴灰色布面罩，穿灰色工装外套，肩上装着黄铜阀门，蒸汽从阀门和他紧握的双拳中喷涌而出。",
  "Keeps it all in. Then does not. Fumi runs the boilers above the Core Sump that keep half of Deepline from freezing. Blocking and taking hits builds pressure, and when it is full his next skill vents: Steam Jet, Scald Step, Boiler Burst, Geyser Field, a Whistle that stuns.": "什么都憋在心里。然后就憋不住了。芙美掌管着核心污水坑上方的锅炉，让半个深线不至于冻僵。格挡和挨打都会积蓄压力，压力满了，他的下一个技能就会泄压：蒸汽喷射，烫步，锅炉爆裂，间歇泉，还有一声能把人震晕的鸣笛。",
  "For a year he heard someone in the pipes under his boilers, tapping. He tapped back. That was how he met Ashka, Subject 60, the furnace's prisoner, and it was the pressure in his pipes that helped blow her free. They are partners now: she burns, he boils.": "整整一年，他听见锅炉底下的管道里有人在敲。他也敲了回去。他就是这样认识了阿什卡——60号实验体，熔炉的囚徒；也正是他管道里的压力，帮着把她炸了出来。如今他们是搭档：她烧，他煮。",
  "He keeps Mako's suit from cooking its pilot, and with Nami he keeps the Drowned Line from rising. When Meltdown opens every valve at once:": "他让马科的机甲不至于把驾驶员煮熟，又和奈美一起让溺亡线的水位不再上涨。当熔毁同时打开所有阀门：",
  "Deepline-born, on the docks.": "生于深线码头。",
  "Dock hand in a suit of armour": "穿着装甲的码头工",
  "A big man inside a bulky orange and grey mech suit, a cannon on one arm, a missile pod on the shoulder, his face showing through a glass visor.": "一个大块头男人，坐在一具笨重的橙灰色机甲里，一条手臂上装着炮，肩上扛着导弹舱，脸从玻璃面罩后露出来。",
  "Built a suit of armour. Then kept building. Mako was a Deepline dock hand who got crushed under a crate once and decided never again. Every year the suit got bigger: Arm Cannon, Thruster Dash, Missile Pod, Ground Pound, Field Repair, and plating that soaks the first hits and rebuilds itself.": "造了一套装甲。然后就没停下。马科原本是深线的码头工，有一次被货箱压在底下，便下定决心：绝不再来一次。这套装甲一年比一年大：臂炮，推进冲撞，导弹舱，地面重击，战地维修，还有一层能吃下最初几次攻击、并会自行修复的装甲板。",
  "Ferra sells him scrap at a family discount. Vex tunes his magnets. Fumi keeps his boiler from cooking him. Dyna makes everything he fires, and she is the only one he lets ride on his shoulders.": "费拉按自家人的折扣卖废铁给他。维克斯替他调校磁铁。芙美让他的锅炉不至于把他煮熟。他射出去的每样东西都出自黛娜之手，而她也是他唯一肯让坐上肩头的人。",
  "He is gentle out of the suit. Inside it, he is the closest thing Deepline has to a tank. When the Full Barrage ends with a shell the size of a car:": "离开机甲，他很温和。在机甲里，他是深线最接近坦克的东西。当全弹发射以一枚汽车大小的炮弹收尾：",
  "Deepline-born, on the Drowned Line.": "生于深线的溺亡线。",
  "Warden of the flooded tunnels": "水淹隧道的看守人",
  "A tall, pale woman with grey-blue skin and messy navy hair, a deep blue coat, and a huge broad cleaver with a sea-blue edge, water dripping from blade and hair.": "一个高挑苍白的女人，皮肤灰蓝，海军蓝的头发乱蓬蓬的，穿深蓝色外套，手持一把刃口泛着海蓝的巨大宽刃砍刀，水从刀刃和发梢滴落。",
  "The sea took her once. She came back with its patience. Nami worked the Drowned Line, the flooded tunnels at the bottom of Deepline, until a wall gave way and the water closed over her. She was under longer than anyone survives. Maren pulled her out, and argued with the sea until it gave her back.": "大海带走过她一次。她回来时，带着大海的耐心。奈美原本在溺亡线干活——深线最底层被水淹没的隧道——直到一面墙塌了，水在她头顶合拢。她在水下待的时间，比任何人能活下来的都长。玛伦把她拉了上来，和大海争了又争，直到大海把她还了回来。",
  "She came up grey and cold, with the Line still in her: Water Bullet, Mist Veil, a Riptide Eel, Bubble Jail, Rising Geyser, and every skill hit drinks some of the enemy's strength. She keeps the Drowned Line now, with Fumi's pumps and a large, friendly puddle called Slick who followed her home.": "她浮上来时灰白冰冷，溺亡线仍留在她身体里：水弹，雾隐，激流鳗，水泡牢笼，升腾间歇泉，每次技能命中都会吸走敌人的一些力量。如今她看守着溺亡线，靠的是芙美的水泵，还有一摊跟着她回家的、又大又友好的水洼，名叫滑溜。",
  "She owes Maren her life, and pays it back by guarding the doctor on every trip underground. When the Abyss Tide floods the arena and comes down:": "她欠玛伦一条命，于是在医生每次下到地底时都守在她身边，以此偿还。当深渊之潮淹没竞技场，又轰然落下：",
  "Aurelia-born, as Director Calder Sayle. Remade inside the Engine.": "生于奥蕾莉亚，那时他还是卡尔德·塞尔总监。在引擎之中被重塑。",
  "What the Director of Halcyon became": "哈尔西恩总监所化之物",
  "A tall shape of black void cracked with violet light, a man's outline at its centre, and the Engine's great wheel turning slowly behind it.": "一道高大的黑色虚空之影，裂缝中透出紫光，中心是一个男人的轮廓；在它身后，引擎的巨轮缓缓转动。",
  "Director Calder Sayle ran Halcyon for twenty years. When Dr. Kessen's Engine tore two worlds into ours, she wanted to switch it off. He wanted to switch it up. He collected the torn-through, numbered them, and fed their power to the Engine through its feed lines. What was left afterwards he called Husks.": "卡尔德·塞尔总监执掌哈尔西恩二十年。凯森博士的引擎把两个世界撕进了我们的世界，她想把它关掉。他想把它开到最大。他把那些穿过裂隙而来的人收拢起来，编上号，再经由供能管线把他们的力量输进引擎。剩下的东西，他称之为空壳。",
  "His plan was to run the Engine harder than it had ever run, open the Beyond all the way and drink it dry, so that Aurelia would never fall again. When the heroes reached the Engine core he stepped backwards into its light, and the Engine took him in. What came out uses everything it ever drank: Void Shard, Rift Step, World Rend, Engine Light.": "他的计划是让引擎以前所未有的强度运转，把彼岸彻底打开，再把它吸干，好让奥蕾莉亚永不再坠落。英雄们抵达引擎核心时，他向后一步，退进了那片光里，引擎接纳了他。从里面出来的东西，能动用引擎吸过的一切：虚空碎片、裂隙步、裂世、引擎之光。",
  "Pell was his hands. Rue was his faces. He never learned one of their names; he only numbered them. When World's End rains on everyone:": "佩尔是他的手。露是他的脸。他们的名字，他一个也没记住；他只给他们编号。当世界终焉如雨般落向每一个人时：",
  "Born by the Frozen Harbour. Fell up through the tear, into the stars between worlds.": "生于冰封港湾。穿过裂隙向上坠落，坠进了世界之间的群星。",
  "Halcyon Subject 88, the pylon of Chamber Six": "哈尔西恩88号实验体，六号室的塔柱",
  "Long midnight-blue hair, a thin gold circlet set with two white gems, a deep violet robe, and a small black sphere ringed in violet light over her palm, tiny stars orbiting it.": "午夜蓝的长发，一顶镶着两颗白宝石的纤细金冠，一袭深紫长袍；掌心上方悬着一颗环绕紫光的黑色小球，几颗小小的星辰绕着它运行。",
  "The harbour's navigators steered by a falling star, and named a girl for it. When the tear opened, Vega fell the other way: up, into the dark between worlds, where stars hang that belong to nobody's sky. She came back carrying the weight of one. Halcyon found her and put her in Pylon Chamber Six.": "港湾的领航员们循着一颗坠落的星辨认航向，还用它给一个女孩取了名。裂隙打开时，维加朝另一个方向坠去：向上，坠进世界之间的黑暗，那里悬着不属于任何一片天空的星星。她回来时，身上压着其中一颗的重量。哈尔西恩找到了她，把她关进了六号塔柱室。",
  "Aurelia floats on anti-gravity pylons. For a year, one of those pylons was Vega. Heavy Star, Crush, a Singularity that grinds, Fall Up that drops enemies into the sky: everything falls toward her eventually, and for a year a whole city was falling toward her and never hitting the ground.": "奥蕾莉亚浮在反重力塔柱之上。曾有一年，其中一根塔柱就是维加。重星、碾压、碾磨万物的奇点、让敌人朝天空坠落的逆坠：万物终将向她坠落；而那一年里，一整座城市都在向她坠落，却始终没有落地。",
  "Tessa, who knows how every story ends, sat with her in the dark and told her about the one where she lets go. Lux, from a world of light, calls her the only kind star she has met. When Event Horizon lifts every enemy and gravity remembers them:": "泰莎知道每个故事如何收场。她在黑暗中陪维加坐着，给她讲了其中一个：她放手的那一个。来自光之世界的卢克丝说，维加是她见过的唯一一颗温柔的星。当事件视界托起所有敌人，而重力重新想起他们时：",
  "Born by the Frozen Harbour. Came out of the tear unstuck in time.": "生于冰封港湾。走出裂隙时，已在时间里脱了锚。",
  "Halcyon Subject 09, reader of the Archive": "哈尔西恩09号实验体，档案馆的解读者",
  "Short auburn hair, brass goggles pushed up on her forehead, a brown waistcoat over rolled white sleeves, a pocket watch held up on its chain, clock hands glowing round her.": "赤褐色短发，黄铜护目镜推在额头上，白衬衫袖子卷起，外罩棕色马甲，提着链子举起一块怀表，身边环绕着发光的表针。",
  "A girl with ink on her nose used to write tomorrow's tides on a slate on the harbour wall, and she was never once wrong. The tear opened through time as well as space, and Tessa came out of it unstuck. She has lived this year more times than she will say. She has already seen how it ends. She did not like it.": "从前有个鼻尖沾着墨水的女孩，总在港湾墙上的石板上写下明天的潮汐，一次也没错过。裂隙不只撕开了空间，也撕开了时间，泰莎从里面出来时，已经脱了锚。这一年她已经活过许多遍，究竟几遍，她不肯说。她已经见过结局了。她不喜欢。",
  "Stopwatch, Rewind, Slow Hour, Second Hand, Time Bomb, and the Stopped Clock. Halcyon kept her in the Archive, numbered 09, to read the future for the Director. She read him the bad endings and kept the good one to herself. She showed it to Isa. She sat with Vega in the dark and told her about it.": "秒表、回溯、缓时、秒针、定时炸弹，还有停摆之钟。哈尔西恩把她关在档案馆，编号09，替总监解读未来。她给他读了那些坏结局，把那个好结局留给了自己。她给伊莎看过。她在黑暗中陪维加坐着，讲给她听。",
  "Corvin's crows bring omens; Tessa thinks they are guessing. Orin keeps finding doors she has already walked through. This time round, she is trying the other door. When the Stopped Clock starts again:": "科尔文的乌鸦带来预兆；泰莎觉得它们只是在瞎猜。欧林总会找到她早已走过的门。这一轮，她要试试另一扇门。当停摆之钟再次走动时：",
  "Born on Vharra's steppe. Fell through the tear, and through the dark beyond it.": "生于瓦拉的草原。坠入裂隙，又穿过了裂隙之外的黑暗。",
  "Walker of the Beyond's doors": "行走于彼岸之门的人",
  "Spiky dark violet hair, a deep indigo sleeveless coat, forearms wrapped in glowing magenta cloth, one hand pushing through a tall magenta doorway hanging in the air.": "深紫色的刺猬头，深靛蓝色无袖外套，前臂缠着发光的品红布条，一只手正推过一道悬在半空的高大品红门框。",
  "A herder's tent on the steppe had a flap at each end. A boy walked in one side while his mother counted to ten at the other, and he came out of a tent three camps away, grinning, with somebody else's bread. When the sky tore, Orin was standing in a doorway. He fell through the tear, and through the dark beyond it, and found that the dark was full of doors.": "草原上有一顶牧人的帐篷，两头各有一道门帘。一个男孩从这头钻进去，他母亲在那头数到十，他却从三个营地外的另一顶帐篷里钻了出来，咧着嘴笑，手里拿着别人家的面包。天空撕裂时，欧林正站在一道门口。他坠入裂隙，又穿过了裂隙之外的黑暗，发现那片黑暗里满是门。",
  "Block at the last instant and he is simply somewhere else: a Rift Bolt that passes through walls, a Fold that drags you through to his feet, Gate Lance, Back Door, Door Barrage. Halcyon caught him on Platform Zero, the oldest stop in Deepline, stepping out of nothing. He did not stay caught.": "他在最后一刻格挡，人就已经到了别处：能穿墙的裂隙弹、把你拖到他脚边的折叠、门扉长枪、后门、门之齐射。哈尔西恩在零号站台抓住了他，那是深线最古老的一站，当时他正从虚无中迈出来。他没被关住多久。",
  "Isa slams doors with ink and Orin opens them; they will never agree which is harder. Mira and Tessa are the only ones who can follow where he goes, and he is the one who means to close the Director's door behind him. When the Thousand Doors shut:": "伊莎用墨把门砰地关上，欧林把门打开；哪件事更难，他们永远争不出结果。只有米拉和泰莎跟得上他的去向，而打算在身后关上总监那扇门的人，正是他。当千门关闭时：",
  "Born by the Frozen Harbour, its watchman in the dark. The first thing to come back out of the Beyond.": "生于冰封港湾，是它在黑暗中的守夜人。第一个从彼岸回来的东西。",
  "Halcyon Subject 00, of the Blank Wing": "哈尔西恩空白侧楼的00号实验体",
  "A hooded swordsman in matte black and dark teal, his face lost in shadow except for one glowing teal eye, gripping a hilt whose blade is only a thin teal outline in the air.": "一名身着哑光黑与暗青色的兜帽剑客，面容隐没在阴影中，只有一只眼睛泛着青光；他握着一柄剑柄，剑刃不过是空中一道细细的青色轮廓。",
  "In the harbour at night there was nothing in the dark that was not supposed to be there. Noct kept it that way. When the tear opened, things came out of the dark between worlds, and he went in after them. He was the first thing that came back. Halcyon numbered him 00 and kept him in the Blank Wing, a room with no shadows in it.": "夜里的港湾，黑暗中从没有不该在那里的东西。诺克特让它一直如此。裂隙打开时，有东西从世界之间的黑暗里出来了，他便追了进去。他是第一个回来的东西。哈尔西恩给他编号00，把他关在空白侧楼——一个没有一丝阴影的房间。",
  "The cut arrives. He does not. Unseen Cut, Afterimage, a Null Crescent through everything, Lights Out, Blink Strike. Vesper lit the harbour's lamps and he kept the dark beyond them clean. They found each other again in Halcyon's halls, and never needed to say so.": "斩击到了。他没到。无形斩、残影、斩穿一切的虚月斩、熄灯、瞬闪斩。韦斯帕点亮港湾的灯，他守着灯光之外的黑暗，让它保持干净。他们在哈尔西恩的走廊里重逢，从来不需要把这件事说出口。",
  "Sen has sworn to see his blade once. Corvin's crows will not fly near him. He speaks very rarely. When the Last Light falls and everything on the screen is on the wrong side of it:": "森恩发誓要亲眼看一次他的剑刃。科尔文的乌鸦不肯飞近他。他很少开口。当余晖落下，屏幕上的一切都落在它错误的那一侧时：",
  "The reflection under the Frozen Harbour's ice. Stepped out when the tear cracked it.": "冰封港湾冰面下的倒影。裂隙震裂冰面时，她走了出来。",
  "Halcyon Subject 03, of the Observation Gallery": "哈尔西恩观察廊的03号实验体",
  "Long slate-grey hair, a smooth silver mirror mask over the upper half of her face with one cyan glint, a grey-blue tunic, and a long mirror shard in which her reflection faces the other way.": "石板灰的长发，上半张脸覆着一副光滑的银色镜面面具，闪着一点青光；一身灰蓝色长衫，手持一块长长的镜子碎片，碎片里她的倒影朝着另一个方向。",
  "At noon on the harbour, if you looked down into the ice, there was a girl underneath it smiling up at you. When the tear cracked the ice, she stepped out. Mira is the reflection. Somewhere there is a girl with no reflection, and Mira has never gone to look for her.": "正午时分，在港湾上低头看冰，冰下会有一个女孩仰着脸冲你微笑。裂隙震裂冰面时，她走了出来。米拉就是那个倒影。某个地方有一个没有倒影的女孩，而米拉从没去找过她。",
  "What you hit was only her reflection: Glass Fan, Reflection, Prism, Hall of Mirrors, Kaleidoscope. Halcyon numbered her 03 and put her behind the glass of the Observation Gallery. For her, glass was only ever a door.": "你打中的只是她的倒影：玻璃扇、反射、棱镜、镜厅、万花镜。哈尔西恩给她编号03，把她放在观察廊的玻璃后面。对她来说，玻璃从来都只是一扇门。",
  "Rue copies faces and Mira reflects them, and there is a difference: in a mirror, Mira is the only one who can see what Rue really is, which is nothing. Lux bends light through her glass. Orin walks through the doors she does. When Seven Years' Luck cracks the world:": "露复制面孔，米拉映照面孔，这两者有区别：在镜子里，只有米拉看得见露的真面目——什么都没有。卢克丝借她的玻璃折转光线。欧林和她穿过同样的门。当七年之运让世界碎裂时：",
  "Born on a world that ended before the Engine ever found it.": "生于一个在引擎找到它之前就已终结的世界。",
  "The ghost of the Bone Garden": "骸骨花园的幽灵",
  "A thin young woman with pale grey-green skin in a dark navy hood and ragged cloak, glowing mint-green eyes, voodoo pins between her fingers, ghost light round her.": "一个肤色苍白、泛着灰绿的瘦削年轻女子，戴着深藏青色兜帽，披着破烂的斗篷，双眼闪着薄荷绿的光，指间夹着巫毒针，周身萦绕着幽光。",
  "Hex and her twin brother Corvin come from a world that ended before the Engine ever found it. Everything there happened twice: once when it happened, and again later, when it was remembered. Hex still works that way. A part of everything she does to you hits again two seconds later.": "赫克丝和她的双胞胎兄弟科尔文，来自一个在引擎找到它之前就已终结的世界。那里的一切都会发生两次：一次在它发生时，另一次在之后，被人记起时。赫克丝至今仍是这样。她对你做的每一件事，都有一部分会在两秒后再打你一次。",
  "Hex Bolt, Soul Swap, Voodoo Pins, a Doom Mark that goes off whatever you do, and Hollow, where she drifts through you as a ghost. She came through the tear already half a ghost, and found the only quiet place on the near side: Thorne's Bone Garden, where the dead do not mind company.": "咒弹、换魂、巫毒针、无论你做什么都会引爆的厄运印记，还有空灵——她化作幽灵，从你身体里飘过。她穿过裂隙时就已经半是幽灵，并在此岸找到了唯一一处安静的地方：索恩的骸骨花园，那里的死者不介意有人作伴。",
  "Rue tried to copy her once and felt everything twice for a week. Hex found that funny. Corvin worries about her; she curses him for it. When the Requiem has sung and every wound opens twice:": "露曾试着复制她一次，结果整整一周，每种感觉都要来两遍。赫克丝觉得这很好笑。科尔文为她担心；她为此诅咒他。当安魂曲唱罢，每一道伤口都裂开两次时：",
  "Born on a world that ended. Came through with his twin, and the crows.": "生于一个已经终结的世界。与双胞胎姐妹一同穿越而来，还带着那群乌鸦。",
  "Reader of omens": "预兆的解读者",
  "A gaunt young man in a black feathered hood with a gold beak-shaped clasp, one eye glowing violet, black crows bursting out of his cloak.": "一个形容枯槁的年轻男子，戴着黑色羽毛兜帽，扣着鸟喙形状的金扣，一只眼睛泛着紫光，黑色的乌鸦从他的斗篷里蜂拥而出。",
  "You hit him. You hit a crow. Corvin and his twin sister Hex came out of a dead world through the tear, and the crows came with them: they are what his world sent to watch its own end. Crow Volley, Scatter, Black Flame, Moon Gaze, Murder of Crows.": "你打中了他。你打中了一只乌鸦。科尔文和他的双胞胎姐妹赫克丝从一个死去的世界穿过裂隙而来，乌鸦也跟着来了：它们是他的世界派来见证自身终结的。群鸦齐射、散鸦、黑炎、月之凝视、鸦群。",
  "He reads omens. He has read this world's, and he does not like it. Tessa says omens are only guesses; Corvin says time is only a crow that has not landed yet. His crows went for Isolde's ice falcon on her first night free, and she has hated every crow since. He has apologised eleven times.": "他解读预兆。他读过这个世界的预兆，并不喜欢。泰莎说预兆不过是瞎猜；科尔文说时间不过是一只还没落地的乌鸦。伊索德重获自由的第一个夜里，他的乌鸦扑向了她的冰隼，从此她恨透了所有乌鸦。他已经道过十一次歉了。",
  "Noct is the one thing his crows will not fly near. Hex he would give the last of his world for. When the Crow Eclipse turns the sky red:": "诺克特是他的乌鸦唯一不肯靠近的东西。为了赫克丝，他愿意交出他那个世界仅剩的一切。当鸦蚀把天空染红时：",
  "Came through the tear with no face, no voice and no shape.": "穿过裂隙而来，没有脸，没有声音，也没有形体。",
  "Pell's best spy, until she was not": "佩尔最得力的间谍，直到她不再是",
  "A slim young woman in a white theatre mask with a painted smile, peach and pink clothes, a second mask in her hand, faint ghostly copies of other fighters behind her.": "一个身形纤细的年轻女子，戴着画有笑容的白色戏剧面具，穿着桃色与粉色的衣服，手里还拿着另一副面具，身后浮现着其他战士淡淡的幽灵般的复制体。",
  "She came through the tear with no face, no voice and no shape of her own. Halcyon put her in the Blank Wing next to Noct. Pell found her there and taught her the only thing she had a talent for: show her a move once, and she will show it back to you, better.": "她穿过裂隙时，没有属于自己的脸、声音和形体。哈尔西恩把她安置在空白侧楼，就在诺克特隔壁。佩尔在那里找到她，教会了她唯一有天分的事：给她看一遍招式，她就能还给你，而且更好。",
  "Copy, Mirror Step, Masquerade, Perfect Copy, Echo. For the Director she wore anyone's face. She wore Kael's to turn the Sky against Deepline, and Nyra's to turn Deepline against the Sky, and for a whole season every layer believed it.": "复制、镜步、假面舞、完美复制、回声。她为总监戴上任何人的脸。她戴上凯尔的脸，让天空与深线反目；又戴上妮拉的脸，让深线与天空反目。整整一季，每一层都信以为真。",
  "Mira looked at her in a mirror and saw nothing, and Rue has hated mirrors since. Kiri and Rook, with their doubles and clones, are the only ones she cannot copy without getting lost. It was Slick, who has no shape either, who asked her what she looked like underneath, and waited for the answer. When the Masquerade Ball ends:": "米拉在镜中看她，什么也没看见，从此露就恨上了镜子。基里和鲁克有替身和分身，只有这两人，她一复制就会迷失自己。是同样没有形体的滑溜问她，她底下是什么样子，然后等着她的回答。当假面舞会落幕时：",
  "Born on a world of crystal and light. Fell into the eastern desert.": "生于一个水晶与光的世界。坠落在东部沙漠。",
  "The girl who made the Glass Sea": "造出玻璃之海的女孩",
  "A gentle young woman with pink hair in a bun, a pale blue and pink outfit, a glowing pink crystal in her hands, and pink, mint and blue crystals growing round her feet.": "一个温柔的年轻女子，粉色头发挽成发髻，穿着淡蓝与粉色相间的衣裳，双手捧着一块发光的粉色水晶，脚边生长着粉色、薄荷绿和蓝色的水晶。",
  "Opal and her sister Lux come from a world of crystal and light, where every garden grows gems. The tear set her down in the eastern desert, and everything she touched turned to crystal: half a mile of sand in one frightened night. That was the beginning of the Glass Sea.": "欧泊和她的姐妹卢克丝来自一个水晶与光的世界，那里的每座花园都长着宝石。裂隙把她放在了东部沙漠，她碰到什么，什么就化作水晶：惊惶的一夜之间，半英里的沙地。那就是玻璃之海的开端。",
  "Crystal Shard grows a crystal where it lands; Geode Wall, Crystal Bloom, a Prism Prison, and a Shatter Song that bursts every crystal she has grown at once. Dune has never forgiven her for the desert. Opal has never forgiven herself.": "水晶碎片落在哪里，哪里就长出水晶；晶洞之墙、水晶绽放、棱镜牢笼，还有让她种下的所有水晶同时迸碎的碎晶之歌。杜恩从未因沙漠的事原谅她。欧泊也从未原谅过自己。",
  "Brakk found her crying in the Glass Sea and carried her out on his shoulder; she still sits there when she is scared. Lux keeps her bright. When Diamond Dust breaks the air itself:": "布拉克在玻璃之海里发现她在哭，把她扛在肩上带了出来；直到现在，她害怕时还会坐到那个肩膀上去。卢克丝让她始终闪亮。当钻石星尘连空气本身都击碎时：",
  "Born on a world of crystal and light. Caught in Halcyon's Med-Lab.": "生于一个水晶与光的世界。被困在哈尔西恩的医疗实验室。",
  "The light that would not bottle": "装不进瓶子的光",
  "Long white hair, a blue and gold outfit, and a thin crystal lance that splits a beam of light into a rainbow, prism colours all round her.": "白色长发，一身蓝金相间的服装，手持一柄细长的水晶长枪，将一束光分解成彩虹，周身流转着棱镜般的色彩。",
  "In the world of crystal and light, Lux was the one who carried the light into the gardens. One beam goes in; seven come out. The tear dropped her sister Opal in the desert and Lux in Halcyon's Med-Lab, where they tried to bottle her and found that light does not bottle.": "在水晶与光的世界里，卢克丝是把光送进花园的人。一束光进去，七束光出来。裂隙把她的姐妹欧泊丢进了沙漠，把卢克丝丢进了哈尔西恩的医疗实验室。他们想把她装进瓶子，结果发现光是装不进瓶子的。",
  "Prism Shot bounces off the edge of the world and hits harder after; Split Beam, Spectrum Lance, Mirror Field, Blinding Flash. Mira's glass bends her light in ways even Lux did not know it could go. She taught Yara to put light on an arrow.": "棱光弹撞上世界的边缘反弹回来，打得更重；分光、光谱长枪、镜阵、致盲闪光。米拉的玻璃能把她的光折向连卢克丝自己都不知道的方向。她教会了雅拉把光搭在箭上。",
  "Vega is the only star she has met here, and the only one that was kind. She keeps Opal bright when the glass gets too heavy. When the Rainbow Road meets in one point:": "维加是她在这里遇见的唯一一颗星，也是唯一一颗温柔的星。玻璃太沉的时候，她让欧泊保持闪亮。当彩虹之路汇于一点时：",
  "Came through the tear as a puddle.": "穿过裂隙时，是一摊水洼。",
  "The friendliest thing on the Drowned Line": "溺亡线上最友善的东西",
  "A round, grinning man made of see-through green slime in a simple dark green vest, wobbling and dripping, puddles round his feet.": "一个圆滚滚、咧嘴笑着的男人，由半透明的绿色黏液构成，穿着一件简单的深绿色背心，晃晃悠悠，滴滴答答，脚边积着水洼。",
  "Squash him flat; he just comes back together. Slick came through the tear as a puddle and spent his first month on the near side being stepped in. He did not mind. He found it a very friendly way to meet people.": "把他拍扁，他也只会重新聚拢。滑溜穿过裂隙时是一摊水洼，来到此岸的头一个月，一直被人踩来踩去。他不介意。他觉得这种认识人的方式非常友好。",
  "Slime Ball, Slide, Engulf, Split, Belly Flop: his slime slows his enemies and heals him, and he is honestly quite hard to hurt. He followed Nami home from the Drowned Line because she was the first person who said sorry after stepping in him. He brings Apis's bees honey from somewhere; nobody asks where.": "黏液球、滑行、吞没、分裂、肚皮砸：他的黏液能减慢敌人，还能治疗他自己，说实话，要伤到他还挺难的。他从溺亡线一路跟着奈美回了家，因为她是第一个踩了他之后说对不起的人。他不知从哪儿给阿琵斯的蜜蜂弄来蜂蜜；没人问是从哪儿。",
  "Rue has no shape either. Slick asked her what she looked like underneath, and waited, and he is the reason she found out. When Tidal Goo has rolled over everyone and squeezed:": "露也没有形体。滑溜问她底下是什么样子，然后一直等着；正是因为他，她才找到了答案。当黏液狂潮从所有人身上碾过，再狠狠一挤时：",
  "Queen of a hive the size of a world, until an engine drank it.": "曾是一座世界般大小的蜂巢的女王，直到一台引擎把它喝干。",
  "The hive that escaped": "逃出来的蜂巢",
  "Black hair under a small golden crown, a striped amber and black jacket, and a cloud of glowing bees circling her outstretched hand.": "黑发上戴着一顶小小的金冠，身穿琥珀色与黑色条纹相间的夹克，一团发光的蜜蜂绕着她伸出的手盘旋。",
  "She is never alone. She is never quiet, either. Apis was the queen of a hive the size of a world, until an engine very like Kessen's found it and drank it dry. She and one swarm escaped through the dark between worlds, and came out of the tear starving.": "她从不孤单。她也从不安静。阿琵斯曾是一座世界般大小的蜂巢的女王，直到一台和凯森那台极其相似的引擎找到它，把它喝得一干二净。她带着仅剩的一群蜜蜂，穿过世界之间的黑暗逃了出来，从裂隙里出来时已经饿得半死。",
  "Sting, Honey Trap, Hive Burst, Royal Jelly, Waggle Dance: every hit adds a bee to her swarm, and at eight they all attack. Ume let her bees feed in the Glowwild when no one else would let them near. Kestra's fire moths and her bees have an understanding, which is that they hate each other.": "蜂刺、蜜糖陷阱、蜂巢爆裂、蜂王浆、摇摆舞：每一次命中都会给她的蜂群添一只蜜蜂，凑满八只，它们便一齐出击。别人都不让她的蜜蜂靠近时，梅让它们在荧野里觅食。凯斯特拉的火蛾和她的蜜蜂之间有一种默契，那就是彼此憎恨。",
  "She is the only one on the near side who has seen what an engine becomes when nobody switches it off. She has told everyone. Slick listened. When the Killer Swarm darkens the sky:": "她是此岸唯一一个亲眼见过引擎没人关掉时会变成什么的人。她告诉了所有人。滑溜听进去了。当杀人蜂群遮暗天空时：",
  "Born on a world with two moons. Came through the Crater rift.": "生于一个有两个月亮的世界。经由陨坑裂隙来到这里。",
  "Traveller between worlds": "穿行于世界之间的旅人",
  "A long silver-white ponytail, a deep indigo bodysuit with periwinkle trim, mid-leap with two crescent blades, two pale moons behind her.": "银白色的长马尾，深靛蓝紧身衣镶着长春花蓝的滚边，手持两柄新月刃，正跃在半空，身后是两轮苍白的月亮。",
  "Look up from Mika's world and you see two moons. The pull of both keeps everyone a little lighter, and children there learn to jump before they learn to walk. Our world has one moon, and Mika has decided that is not reason enough to come down.": "在米卡的世界抬头，能看见两个月亮。两股引力让每个人都轻上几分，那里的孩子先学会跳，再学会走。我们的世界只有一个月亮，米卡认定这不足以成为她落地的理由。",
  "She has not touched the ground since the fight began: Crescent Toss, a Moon Vault over you, Twin Orbit, Lunar Dive, Lunar Halo, and every hit in the air gives her jumps back. Sora, who rides a kite above Aurelia, cannot stand that someone stays up longer. Coda, the Noble Ring's dancer, asked Mika to teach her to leap without a net.": "从战斗开始，她就没碰过地面：新月掷、从你头顶越过的月跃、双轨、月坠、月之光环，而且每一次空中命中，都会把跳跃次数还给她。乘着风筝在奥蕾莉亚上空飞翔的索拉，受不了有人比她在天上待得更久。贵族环区的舞者寇妲请米卡教她不用安全网也能跃起。",
  "She came through the tear with Ryo and Itsuki, who walk between worlds, and she has stayed at Ryo's side, because light and dark need someone between them. When the two moons rise and she cuts across the arena by their light:": "她和行走于世界之间的亮与一树一起穿过了裂隙，之后一直留在亮的身边，因为光与暗之间，总得有个人在。当两轮月亮升起，她借着月光斩过整个竞技场时：",
  "Born between worlds. Walks from tear to tear.": "生于世界之间。从一道裂隙走向另一道裂隙。",
  "Closer of tears, light and dark": "合隙之人，亦光亦暗",
  "A composed young man with short black hair, a gi white on one side and black on the other, one palm glowing white and the other dark, a turning yin-yang circle behind him.": "一个沉稳的年轻男子，黑色短发，道服一半白一半黑，一只手掌泛着白光，另一只笼着暗影，身后有一个旋转的阴阳圆。",
  "Light in one hand, dark in the other; both hands hit. Ryo and his sworn brother Itsuki walk between worlds, closing the tears that engines leave behind. They have closed three. This one is the largest they have ever seen.": "一手是光，一手是暗；两只手都能伤人。亮和他的结义兄弟一树行走于世界之间，闭合那些引擎留下的裂隙。他们已经合上了三道。这一道，是他们见过最大的。",
  "Light Palm, Light Step, Dark Palm, Eclipse, Taiji Turn: switching sides builds Balance, and using the same side twice loses it. Ryo has to keep both sides of everything, himself included. Hollis, who has kept three layers in balance for a lifetime, gave them a room in the Hidden village and listened to them for a whole night.": "光掌、光步、暗掌、日蚀、太极回旋：切换光暗两面可以积累平衡，连续两次用同一面就会失去平衡。亮必须守住万物的两面，包括他自己。霍利斯一辈子都在让三层保持平衡，他在隐秘村落给了他们一个房间，听他们讲了整整一夜。",
  "Mika came through with them and stays at his side. Itsuki wants to rush and Ryo wants to wait; between them they are usually on time. When Harmony turns over the arena and sets everything right:": "米卡和他们一起来到这里，一直留在他身边。一树想快，亮想等；两人加在一起，通常刚好准时。当和谐在竞技场上空回转，让一切各归其位时：",
  "Born between worlds. Learned five elements on five of them.": "生于世界之间。在五个世界学会了五种元素。",
  "Closer of tears, student of five worlds": "合隙之人，五个世界的学徒",
  "Long white hair with two dark crimson horns growing through it, calm half-lidded eyes that glow a soft red, and a long black coat with a crimson core. The five elements turn in the air around him.": "一头长长的白发，两只暗红色的弯角从发间长出；双眼平静而半垂，泛着柔和的红光；身穿一件长长的黑色外套，内里透出深红的核心。五种元素在他身周的空中旋转。",
  "Fire, wind, thunder, earth, water: he learned them all, in that order, on five different worlds. Itsuki and his sworn brother Ryo walk between worlds closing the tears that engines leave behind, and on every world he stays long enough to learn one thing from its best.": "火、风、雷、土、水：他全都学会了，按这个顺序，在五个不同的世界。一树和他的结义兄弟亮行走于世界之间，闭合引擎留下的裂隙；每到一个世界，他都会待上足够久，向那里最强的人学一样本事。",
  "Every skill is cast in his current element, then the wheel turns: Element Bolt, Element Step, Element Pillar, Five Seals, The Wheel Turns. On the near side he went looking for the best of each. He found a boy called Kael throwing thunder in Deepline and challenged him on the spot. He found Gale's wind and asked to be taught; Gale asked to be paid.": "他的每个招式都以当前的元素施展，然后轮盘转动：元素弹、元素步、元素之柱、五印、轮转。来到此岸后，他去寻找每种元素的最强者。他在深线发现一个叫凯尔的男孩在扔雷，当场就向他挑战。他找到了盖尔的风，请盖尔教他；盖尔请他付钱。",
  "He wants to close the tear today; Ryo wants to close it properly. When the Five Calamities fall one after another:": "他想今天就合上裂隙；亮想把它好好合上。当五大天灾接连降下时：",
  "Halcyon said she sold out the tunnels. One fight in the Crater, and he knew it was a lie.": "哈尔西恩说她出卖了隧道。陨坑一战，他就知道那是谎话。",
  "The Deepline boy she was told to fear. The only one who never lied to her.": "他们要她害怕的那个深线少年。唯一从没对她撒过谎的人。",
  "His brother from the slums. Never once fought alone, even before the clones.": "他在贫民窟的兄弟。哪怕在有分身之前，也从没单打独斗过。",
  "Brother from the Deepline slums. The only person louder than Rook.": "深线贫民窟的兄弟。唯一比鲁克还吵的人。",
  "Knew the storm-eye on his jacket for Vharra's, and him for kin. Big brother, uninvited.": "认出他夹克上的瓦拉风暴之眼，也认出他是自己人。不请自来的大哥。",
  "A kid with Vharra's storm in his hair. Fenn decided to keep him alive. It is a full-time job.": "头发里藏着瓦拉风暴的小子。芬恩决定保他活命。这是份全职工作。",
  "Thinks Deepline has one thunder too many. He agrees: hers.": "觉得深线多了一道雷。他同意：多的是她那道。",
  "Throws lightning loudly, everywhere, at everything. Deepline has one thunder too many.": "扔闪电动静极大，四处乱扔，见什么劈什么。深线多了一道雷。",
  "Pulled him out from under a car door in the Crusher Yard and called him salvage.": "在粉碎场把他从一扇车门底下拖出来，认定他还能回收。",
  "The best thing she ever pulled out of the trash. She tells him it was the car door.": "她从垃圾堆里捡过的最好的东西。她跟他说，最好的是那扇车门。",
  "A stranger from another world who wants to learn thunder by losing to it. Not yet.": "来自异界的陌生人，想靠输给雷霆来学会雷霆。还没到时候。",
  "The thunder of this world. Challenged on sight. Still undecided.": "这个世界的雷霆。一见面就下了战书。胜负未定。",
  "Dropped him in the trash and called it an accident.": "把他扔进垃圾堆，说那是个意外。",
  "A number it never bothered to learn. Should have stayed in the trash.": "一个它懒得记住的编号。本该老老实实待在垃圾堆里。",
  "Two tanks down in the Cryo Vault. Taught her to keep her voice low and her blade cold.": "在冷冻库里隔她两个舱。教会她压低声音，让刀锋保持冰冷。",
  "The chick she raised in the vault, without once doing the flying for her.": "她在冷冻库里带大的雏鸟，却从没替她飞过一次。",
  "Carried her out of the Burn Ward on her back, through her own fire.": "背着她，穿过自己的烈火，走出了烧伤病房。",
  "Carried her out of the Burn Ward. Nyra still says she was walking.": "把她背出了烧伤病房。妮拉至今坚称自己是走出来的。",
  "Kept her heart going on the nights the tests went too far.": "实验做过了头的那些夜里，让她的心一直跳着。",
  "Subject 31. Maren kept her alive so that she could leave. She left.": "31号实验体。玛伦让她活下来，好让她能离开。她走了。",
  "Put her in a tank and called it care.": "把她关进舱里，说这是照料。",
  "Subject 31, the one who could see the Husks. Inconvenient.": "31号实验体，能看见空壳的那个。碍事。",
  "Says winter answers to him. She has been invited north to argue.": "声称冬天听他号令。她已受邀北上，去和他争个明白。",
  "A Halcyon Subject who thinks winter is hers. He has asked her to come north and say so.": "哈尔西恩的实验体，以为冬天归她管。他请她北上，当面说说看。",
  "His crows went for her falcon on her first night free. Eleven apologies. Not enough.": "她重获自由的第一晚，他的乌鸦就扑向了她的猎鹰。道歉11次。不够。",
  "His crows went for her falcon once. He has apologised eleven times.": "他的乌鸦扑过她的猎鹰一次。他已经道歉11次了。",
  "Captain of the harbour wall at home. Her falcons used to sit on his gate.": "故乡港湾城墙的守卫队长。她的猎鹰常落在他的城门上。",
  "From home: the eyrie over his gate. He guarded her vault for a year without knowing.": "来自故乡：他城门上方的鹰巢。他替她守了一年冷冻库，却毫不知情。",
  "His little sister. Her kite went up through the tear while he fell down. He has not let her out of sight since.": "他的妹妹。他坠落时，她的风筝穿过裂隙飞上了天。从那以后，他就没让她离开过视线。",
  "Big brother. Fell down a stack and rode the wind back up to find her. Will not stop hovering.": "哥哥。从排风塔上摔下去，又乘风飞回来找她。总在她身边盘旋，赶都赶不走。",
  "Eleven races, eleven arguments. Tarn says riding the wind is cheating.": "比了11场，吵了11架。塔恩说乘风就是作弊。",
  "Rides the wind and calls it running. Eleven races, cheating every time.": "乘着风还说自己在跑。比了11场，场场作弊。",
  "Another Vharra kid who found her own way up. Runs the Paper Post with him and Sora.": "另一个自己找到路爬上来的瓦拉孩子。和他、索拉一起经营纸鹤邮驿。",
  "Rode the updraft up Stack Four while she folded a crane. They compare notes.": "他乘着上升气流飞上四号排风塔时，她正在折一只纸鹤。两人常交流心得。",
  "Reached across a whole field for Sora's kite once. Gale still owes him for it.": "有一次隔着整片田野伸手，够回了索拉的风筝。盖尔至今还欠他这份人情。",
  "Sora's big brother. Owes Bando a kite and a thank-you, in that order.": "索拉的哥哥。欠班多一只风筝和一声谢谢，按这个顺序。",
  "A world-walker who wants to learn the wind. Gale has quoted him a price.": "行走诸界的旅人，想学风。盖尔已经给他报了价。",
  "Has the best wind on this world. Wants paying to teach it.": "拥有这个世界最好的风。教可以，得付钱。",
  "A wall on the Surface that has never been passed. Aldric would like to see that for himself.": "地表上一道从未被突破的墙。奥德瑞想亲眼见识一下。",
  "A knight in the sky who holds a line as well as he does. Tor would like to see that.": "天上的一位骑士，守阵和他一样稳。托尔倒想看看。",
  "Took him down to the Engine's feed lines and showed him what his oath was protecting.": "带他下到引擎的供能管线，让他看清自己的誓言在守护什么。",
  "Lit the lamps on the wall he guarded. Showed him the Husks when he needed to see.": "为他守卫的城墙点灯。在他需要看清的时候，带他看了那些空壳。",
  "His oath was to the people, never to the Director. The Director forgot.": "他的誓言是对人民立的，从来不是对总监。总监忘了这一点。",
  "Subject 12. The finest knight it ever owned. Never owned.": "12号实验体。它拥有过的最好的骑士。从来不属于它。",
  "The only one who ever burned hotter. They met in the fire that ran down to the Core Sump.": "唯一烧得比她更烈的人。两人相识于那场一路烧进核心污水坑的大火。",
  "Her fire came down the vents and found her in the dark. Sisters since.": "她的火顺着通风管烧下来，在黑暗中找到了她。从此便是姐妹。",
  "Claims to be the real phoenix. Eleven fights. Pyra is winning, she says.": "自称真正的凤凰。打了11场。派拉说自己领先。",
  "Walked out of the Burn Ward wearing a phoenix. Kestra took it personally.": "披着一只凤凰走出了烧伤病房。凯斯特拉觉得这是冲她来的。",
  "Mixed the serum. Pyra burned the lab down around her. Still on the list.": "调配了那支血清。派拉把实验室连同她一起烧了。依然在名单上。",
  "Her finest result. It burned her laboratory down and looked her in the eye.": "她最得意的成果。烧掉了她的实验室，还直直地盯着她的眼睛。",
  "Thinks distance is a spear's business. She is ahead on the bet.": "认为距离是长矛的事。这场赌，她领先。",
  "Thinks a bow reaches further. A bow has never stopped a charge.": "觉得弓射得更远。可弓从没挡住过一次冲锋。",
  "Out-shoots her at ten paces. She out-shoots him at a mile.": "10步之内，他比她准。一英里外，她比他准。",
  "Out-shoots him at a mile. He out-shoots her at ten paces. Nobody buys the drinks.": "一英里外她更准，10步之内他更准。谁也不用请酒。",
  "Taught her to put light on the string.": "教她把光搭上弓弦。",
  "The best eye she has met. Lux gave her arrows something to carry.": "她见过眼力最好的人。卢克丝让她的箭有了可载之物。",
  "Also more than one person. The only one who gets it.": "同样不止一个人。唯一懂她的人。",
  "Has a paper double. The only person who understands the clones.": "有个纸做的替身。唯一理解那些分身的人。",
  "Copies everyone, and gets lost copying her double.": "谁都能模仿，一模仿她的替身就迷失了自己。",
  "A copy of a copy is no use to anyone. Rue hates her for it.": "复制品的复制品，对谁都没用。露为此恨她。",
  "Partner on the Paper Post. Sora flies the high letters; Kiri folds the rest.": "纸鹤邮驿的搭档。高处的信由索拉飞送，其余的由基里来折。",
  "Folds the letters; Sora flies them. The Paper Post never misses a tower.": "她折信，索拉飞送。纸鹤邮驿从不漏掉任何一座塔。",
  "Her clan-sister in the undercroft. Keeps Kestra from burning down the beams.": "她在城底暗层的氏族姐妹。不让凯斯特拉把房梁烧了。",
  "Clan-sister. Fire first, then the fan. Lin keeps the beams from catching.": "氏族姐妹。先放火，再挥扇。琳负责让房梁别着火。",
  "Her bees and Kestra's fire moths have an understanding: they hate each other.": "她的蜜蜂和凯斯特拉的火蛾达成了默契：互相憎恨。",
  "Her moths and Apis's bees do not share a sky. It is a matter of principle.": "她的飞蛾和阿琵斯的蜜蜂不共一片天。这是原则问题。",
  "Took her up to the sky and tied a string to every step. Her ribbons are those strings, cut.": "把她带上天空，在她每一步上都系了线。她的彩带，就是那些被剪断的线。",
  "His finest puppet. She cut her own strings mid-performance, which was rude.": "他最好的傀儡。演到一半剪断了自己的线，太没礼貌了。",
  "She learned rhythm counting the tolls of his bell with her feet.": "她用脚数着他的钟声，学会了节奏。",
  "The little girl who counted the tolls. He has rung harder every morning since she was taken.": "那个数钟声的小女孩。自她被带走，他每天早上都把钟敲得更重。",
  "Gave her a seat at the House Edge when she had nowhere else to sit.": "在她无处可坐时，给了她庄家优势赌坊的一个座位。",
  "The Noble Ring's other star. Zara bet on her once. Best bet she ever made.": "贵族环区的另一颗明星。扎拉押过她一次。那是她押得最好的一注。",
  "Taught her to leap without a net.": "教她在没有安全网的地方纵身起跳。",
  "Asked to learn to leap without a net. Learned it in a week.": "想学不靠安全网的跳跃。一周就学会了。",
  "Knew her before the money. They talk about it only across a table, armed.": "在她发财之前就认识她。这件事两人只隔着牌桌、带着武器谈。",
  "Dealt at his table before the Skylift. How that ended is not discussed, except armed.": "登上天梯前，在他的牌桌上发过牌。那段怎么收场的，不带武器不谈。",
  "Stands behind her chair. The house keeps its winnings.": "站在她的椅子后面。庄家的赢钱一分不少。",
  "Her employer. Sees everyone on the Noble Ring, which is why Lin took the job.": "她的雇主。贵族环区的每个人她都见得到，琳正是为此接下了这份差事。",
  "Argued with the sea until it gave her back.": "跟大海争了又争，直到它把她还回来。",
  "Pulled her out of the Drowned Line. Nami guards the doctor's back in return.": "把她从溺亡线里拉了出来。作为回报，奈美替这位医生守着后背。",
  "Calls what Vesna does a sickness. Vesna calls it bookkeeping.": "说维斯娜干的事是一种病。维斯娜管这叫记账。",
  "A doctor who gives it away for free. Bad for business.": "一个分文不取的医生。影响生意。",
  "Knows exactly what Elixa's serums did. She treated it.": "清楚艾莉克莎的血清造成了什么。那些都是她治的。",
  "Checks every flask Elixa makes now. Annoyingly, she is usually right.": "如今艾莉克莎配的每一瓶药她都要查。烦人的是，她通常是对的。",
  "Sells her Glowwild spores for the cure. Asks what for, every time.": "把荧野的孢子卖给她做解药。每次都要问用来做什么。",
  "Buys spores. Ume checks what for. So far the answer has been a good one.": "来买孢子。梅会问清用途。目前为止，答案都还不错。",
  "Opens doors. She closes them. They will never agree which is harder.": "他开门，她关门。哪个更难，两人永远争不出结果。",
  "Slams doors with ink. He opens them. Neither is giving ground.": "用墨水把门砰地关上。他再打开。谁也不让谁。",
  "Drew lines beside her at the old school on the steppe. She writes to him from the Archive.": "当年在草原的旧学堂里，与她并肩画线。如今她从档案馆给他写信。",
  "The other student who could draw a line nobody could cross. She writes; he answers in one line.": "另一个能画出无人可越之线的学生。她写信，他只回一行。",
  "Guards her brush hand when she writes the dangerous seals.": "她书写危险的封印时，替她护住执笔的手。",
  "Writes the dangerous words. Lin stands close while she does.": "写下危险的字句。她写的时候，琳就守在近旁。",
  "Showed her the last page of the Director's story, in the Archive.": "在档案馆里给她看了总监故事的最后一页。",
  "Read the Director's last page to her. Isa decided to write a different one.": "把总监的最后一页念给她听。伊莎决定写一页不一样的。",
  "Calls her style soft. She has sealed him twice.": "说她的路数太软。她已经封印过他两次。",
  "Calls his style loud. Has sealed him twice. He is working on it.": "说他的路数太吵。封印过他两次。他还在努力。",
  "She lit the harbour's lamps; he kept the dark beyond them clean.": "她点亮港口的灯；他让灯外的黑暗保持干净。",
  "Lit the lamps while he kept the dark. They found each other again without a word.": "他守着黑暗，她点着灯。两人重逢时，一言未发。",
  "Thinks shadows are for hiding. She walks through them.": "以为影子是用来藏身的。她却直接穿行而过。",
  "Walks through his shadows like doors, across his rooftops. Rude.": "把他的影子当门穿，在他的屋顶上来去。真没礼貌。",
  "Wants to be every beast at once. One wolf is plenty.": "想同时变成所有野兽。一头狼就够了。",
  "A one-trick wolf. They hunt together anyway.": "只会一招的狼。他们照样一起狩猎。",
  "Ran the steppe with him once. Still the only one who kept pace.": "曾和他一起奔过草原。至今仍是唯一跟得上的人。",
  "Ran the steppe with him. A storm-wolf is the one thing Tarn never outran.": "曾与他一起奔过草原。风暴之狼是塔恩唯一没能甩开的东西。",
  "The only one who out-howls him.": "唯一嚎得比他响的人。",
  "The only man he lets hunt beside him.": "他唯一允许在身旁一同狩猎的人。",
  "Sat down beside him on the mountain and taught him that a mountain can choose where it stands.": "在山上坐到他身旁，教他明白：一座山也能选择自己立在哪里。",
  "A mountain that walked up through four hundred metres of rock. Hollis taught it where to stop.": "一座穿过400米岩层走上来的山。霍利斯教会了它在哪里停下。",
  "Wants to know which of them is harder to move. Brakk lets him lose.": "想知道两人谁更难被推动。布拉克就让他输。",
  "Came closest to pushing him out of the ring. Brakk is a mountain.": "最接近把他推出土俵的人。布拉克可是一座山。",
  "Found her crying in the Glass Sea. She rides on his shoulder when she is scared.": "在玻璃之海发现她在哭。她一害怕就坐到他肩上。",
  "Carried her out of the Glass Sea. His shoulder is the safest place on the near side.": "把她从玻璃之海扛了出来。他的肩膀是此岸最安全的地方。",
  "Says he is just a bomb with a slower fuse. She has offered to show him a fuse.": "说他不过是颗引信慢一点的炸弹。她提出让他见识见识引信。",
  "No sense of timing, says Jax. She has offered to show him a fuse.": "杰克斯说她毫无时机感。她提出让他见识见识引信。",
  "Starts every run from his porch. Jax keeps his water cold.": "每一趟都从他的门廊出发。杰克斯总给他备着凉水。",
  "Every run starts on his porch at Mile Zero. The water is always cold.": "每一趟都从他在零英里的门廊出发。水永远是凉的。",
  "Trains before dawn to catch him. Tarn trains at night, and has not said.": "天亮前就起来训练，想追上他。塔恩在夜里训练，只是没说。",
  "Runs the roads for a living. Ivo is going to catch him on foot. Eventually.": "靠在路上奔跑谋生。伊沃要徒步追上他。总有一天。",
  "Followed him north for a month to learn the bear. Allowed, on condition he stopped talking.": "跟着他北上一个月，只为学熊。他准了，条件是别再说话。",
  "The last bear. Taught him the one beast he could never catch, on condition of silence.": "最后一头熊。以沉默为条件，教会了他唯一没能抓住的野兽。",
  "Fought his raiders for years. Took his chain when Halcyon's drills came. Still does not like him.": "和他的掠夺者打了好些年。哈尔西恩的钻机来时，她接过了他的锁链。至今仍不喜欢他。",
  "Lost more chains to her sand than he can count. Now she holds one end of his.": "被她的沙子吞掉的锁链多得数不清。如今，她握着他锁链的一端。",
  "Turned half her desert into the Glass Sea in one night. Dune has not forgiven the glass.": "一夜之间把她的半片沙漠变成了玻璃之海。杜恩至今没原谅那些玻璃。",
  "The guardian of the desert she glassed. Opal has not forgiven herself either.": "被她化作玻璃的那片沙漠的守护者。欧泊也没原谅自己。",
  "Sits with her in the desert on the longest night of every year.": "每年最长的那一夜，都在沙漠里陪她坐着。",
  "Walks into the desert every longest night to sit with her. Neither says much.": "每逢最长之夜，便走进沙漠陪她坐着。两人都不多话。",
  "Made the Pact with him by firelight. They still argue about the second line.": "在火光下与他订立盟约。两人至今还在争第二行。",
  "Made the Pact beside him. Still argues about the second line, which is hard without speaking.": "与他并肩订立盟约。至今还在争第二行，不开口吵架可不容易。",
  "Waited a year of sunrises to be taught. Still trains before every one.": "等了一年的日出才得以拜师。至今每次日出前都在训练。",
  "Told him to wait for the sunrise. He waited a year of them.": "叫他等日出。他等了一年的日出。",
  "A young man who keeps two sides in balance. Hollis kept three for a lifetime. They talked all night.": "一个让两面保持平衡的年轻人。霍利斯让三层平衡了一辈子。两人聊了一整夜。",
  "Kept three layers in balance for a lifetime. Gave them a room and listened all night.": "一辈子维持着三层的平衡。给了他们一个房间，听了整整一夜。",
  "Sends cuttings from his bone garden every spring. She sends back pollen.": "每年春天寄来他骸骨花园的插枝。她回赠花粉。",
  "A fellow gardener. Her pollen makes the catacombs sneeze for a week.": "同为园丁。她的花粉能让地下墓穴打上一周喷嚏。",
  "Let her starving bees feed when nobody else would.": "在没人肯的时候，让她饥饿的蜂群进食。",
  "Let the swarm feed in the Glowwild when no one else would let them near.": "没人肯让蜂群靠近时，她让它们在荧野里进食。",
  "Shadows his caravans through the Glowwild. Hart has not noticed.": "暗中尾随他的商队穿过荧野。哈特还没察觉。",
  "Leaves meat out for whatever follows the caravans. Has not noticed it is a person.": "给尾随商队的东西留肉。没发现那是个人。",
  "His shield at the head of every caravan.": "他的盾，走在每支商队的最前方。",
  "The spear behind his shield. They stopped arguing years ago.": "他盾后的那杆长矛。两人多年前就不吵了。",
  "Spars with him every morning. Has not moved him yet.": "每天早上和他对练。还没撼动过他。",
  "Every dawn, the same wall. Ivo has not moved him.": "每个黎明，都是同一堵墙。伊沃从没撼动过他。",
  "Blesses his ring with the bell every spring.": "每年春天用钟为他的土俵祈福。",
  "Bows to the bell before every bout. The bell rings back.": "每场比试前都向钟鞠躬。钟会回响。",
  "Wants to settle which of them is the true wall.": "想弄清两人谁才是真正的墙。",
  "Thinks he is the immovable one. Tor would like a word.": "以为自己才是不可撼动的那个。托尔有话要说。",
  "Claims a longer reach, in public. Has been invited down to Deepline to measure.": "当众宣称自己臂展更长。已被邀请下到深线去比一比。",
  "Claims to have the longer reach. Bando has invited him down to measure.": "声称自己够得更远。班多请他下来量一量。",
  "Forged his sickle and keeps it sharp.": "为他锻造了镰刀，并一直替他磨得锋利。",
  "Brings the sickle back notched every time. Garo likes to see it used.": "每次送回来的镰刀都带着缺口。加罗喜欢看它被好好用过。",
  "Sends the best steel in Deepline up through tunnels no map shows. Never seen her face.": "经由地图上没有的隧道，把深线最好的钢送上来。从没见过她的脸。",
  "A smith on the Surface she has never met. She would die for him. That is what the Pact was for.": "地表上一位她从未谋面的铁匠。她愿为他而死。盟约本就是为此而立。",
  "Holds the gate with him: one throws, one catches.": "和他一起守门：一个投，一个接。",
  "Forged his shield. They hold the gate together.": "为他锻造了盾牌。两人一同守门。",
  "Tapped to her through the pipes every night of the year she spent in the Sump.": "她困在污水坑的那一年，他每晚都敲着管道跟她说话。",
  "The voice in the pipes under his boilers. She burns, he boils.": "他锅炉下方管道里的那个声音。她燃烧，他沸腾。",
  "Blew the Core Sump's door off. Allowed to watch every eruption since.": "炸飞了核心污水坑的门。此后每次喷发都准她到场观看。",
  "Her biggest job: the door of the Core Sump. Front row for every eruption since.": "她干过的最大一单：核心污水坑的门。此后每次喷发都坐第一排。",
  "She makes the bombs; he carries them in a suit that can take the blast.": "她造炸弹；他穿着扛得住爆炸的装甲带着它们。",
  "Makes everything he fires. The only one allowed on his shoulders.": "他发射的一切都出自她手。唯一能坐在他肩上的人。",
  "She blows holes in walls; he reaches through them.": "她在墙上炸洞；他把手伸过去。",
  "Blows a hole in something for him most weeks. Usually on purpose.": "差不多每周都替他炸个洞。通常是故意的。",
  "Reached across a field for her tangled kite. Still tells everyone he saved her.": "隔着一片田野伸手去够她缠住的风筝。至今逢人就说是他救了她。",
  "Reached for her kite on festival day. Tells everyone he saved her. He sort of did.": "节日那天伸手够到了她的风筝。逢人就说是他救了她。某种程度上，确实如此。",
  "Her apprentice, until he decided pull and push were the same thing. She watches his fights.": "曾是她的学徒，直到他认定拉和推是一回事。她会看他的每场战斗。",
  "Taught him everything except how to agree with her. He set up across the tunnel.": "什么都教给了他，唯独没教会他认同她。他在隧道对面另立门户。",
  "His armour is her scrap, at a family discount.": "他的装甲是她的废料，自家人折扣价。",
  "Sells him scrap at a family discount. Most of the suit is her junk.": "按自家人折扣卖废料给他。这身装甲大半是她的破烂。",
  "The only blade he could not see. He means to, once.": "唯一他看不见的刀。他打算看清一次。",
  "Has sworn to see his blade. Noct has not decided whether to let him.": "发誓要看清他的刀。诺克特还没决定要不要让他看。",
  "Came to the Rust Dojo after Pell and asked to learn the Flash Step properly. A week of silence; then he taught her.": "佩尔的事之后，她来到锈蚀道场，请求好好学一学闪步。沉默一周，然后他教了她。",
  "Taught her the true Flash Step after a week of silence. Worth it.": "沉默一周之后，教了她真正的闪步。值得。",
  "The Lantern Cell. She always finished first.": "灯笼小队。她总是第一个完成。",
  "The Lantern Cell. Held the door so she could run. She has not thanked him. She will.": "灯笼小队。他守住那扇门，好让她逃走。她还没谢过他。她会的。",
  "The Lantern Cell. Carries Rook's guilt so Rook does not have to notice it.": "灯笼小队。替鲁克背着愧疚，好让鲁克不必察觉。",
  "The loud one of the Cell. Moro carries his guilt for him.": "小队里最吵的那个。莫罗替他背着愧疚。",
  "Taught him the clones, then sold the Cell to Halcyon.": "教会了他分身，然后把小队卖给了哈尔西恩。",
  "His best student. The clones held a door Pell needed open.": "他最好的学生。那些分身挡住了一扇佩尔需要打开的门。",
  "Copied his clones. For a week there were far too many Rooks.": "模仿了他的分身。那一周，鲁克多得过了头。",
  "Copied his clones once. Too many of him, even for her.": "模仿过一次他的分身。他实在太多了，连她都受不了。",
  "Sold the Cell. She has been running at him ever since.": "出卖了小队。从那以后，她一直冲着他去。",
  "The quiet one. He should have watched the quiet one.": "安静的那个。他早该提防那个安静的。",
  "Ran beside her through the dark when the Cell was sold.": "小队被出卖时，在黑暗中与她并肩奔逃。",
  "Ran beside him while Rook held the door. Neither says much about it.": "鲁克守门时，与他并肩奔逃。两人都很少提起。",
  "Taught him that shadows hide things. He decided they should hold things.": "教他影子能藏东西。他却认定影子该用来困住东西。",
  "The sleepy one. Always had the answer. Pell never liked that.": "爱打瞌睡的那个。却总有答案。佩尔从来不喜欢这点。",
  "Told him he was keeping the layers in balance. Pell believed it for ten years.": "告诉他，他是在维持各层的平衡。佩尔信了10年。",
  "Its hands for ten years. Strings in every layer.": "做了它10年的手。每一层都有他的线。",
  "Found her in the Blank Wing and taught her to wear anyone's face.": "在空白侧楼找到她，教她戴上任何人的脸。",
  "Taught her faces. Never once asked her for her own.": "教她各种面孔。却从没问过她自己的。",
  "She keeps the debts of the living, he the dead. Tea on Sundays.": "她管活人的债，他管死人的。周日一起喝茶。",
  "Keeps the debts of the dead. The only one in Deepline she does not charge.": "掌管死者的债。深线唯一一个她不收钱的人。",
  "Visits the garden because it is the only quiet place on the near side.": "常来花园，因为那是此岸唯一安静的地方。",
  "His garden is the only quiet place on the near side. The dead do not mind company.": "他的花园是此岸唯一安静的地方。死者不介意有人作伴。",
  "Tunes his magnets. The only friend he kept from the Yard.": "替他调校磁铁。他从粉碎场留下的唯一朋友。",
  "Tunes his magnets. Talks too much about polarity.": "给他调校磁铁。一说起极性就没完没了。",
  "Lent him the money for his own yard. Has been collecting ever since.": "借钱给他开了自己的废料场。从那以后一直在收债。",
  "Borrowed to build his own yard. Will owe her more than he will ever have.": "借钱开了自己的废料场。欠她的，比他这辈子能挣到的还多。",
  "Keeps the Drowned Line from rising with her. His pumps, her patience.": "和她一起不让溺亡线上涨。他出水泵，她出耐心。",
  "His pumps keep the Line from rising. She keeps him company while they run.": "他的水泵让溺亡线不再上涨。水泵运转时，她陪着他。",
  "Keeps the boiler in his suit from cooking him.": "不让他装甲里的锅炉把他煮熟。",
  "Keeps the boiler in the suit from cooking him. Twice so far, literally.": "不让装甲里的锅炉把他煮熟。目前已有两次，字面意义上的。",
  "A friendly puddle that followed her home because she said sorry.": "一摊友好的水洼，因为她说了声对不起，就跟着她回了家。",
  "The first person who said sorry after stepping in him. He followed her home.": "踩到他之后，第一个说对不起的人。他跟着她回了家。",
  "Pylon Chamber Six. One of the pylons a city floats on.": "六号塔柱室。托起一座城市的塔柱之一。",
  "Made her hold up his city for a year.": "逼她托着他的城市，整整一年。",
  "A boy who walks through doors. A danger to the only door that matters.": "一个能穿门而行的少年。威胁着唯一重要的那扇门。",
  "Opened the door between worlds and walked through it. Orin is here to close it behind him.": "打开了世界之间的门，走了进去。欧林来此，就是要在他身后把门关上。",
  "The queen of a world another engine drank. She knows too much about engines.": "一个被另一台引擎吸干的世界的女王。她对引擎知道得太多了。",
  "She has seen what an engine becomes when nobody switches it off. This one.": "她见过没人关掉的引擎会变成什么。就是这个。",
  "Sat with her in the Pylon Chamber and told her about the ending where she lets go.": "在塔柱室里陪她坐着，跟她讲了那个她放手的结局。",
  "The weight of a star, holding up a city. Tessa told her how it ends, not how it starts.": "以一颗星的重量托起一座城。泰莎告诉了她结局，没告诉她开头。",
  "From a world of light. Calls her the only kind star she has met.": "来自光的世界。说她是自己见过的唯一一颗温柔的星。",
  "The only star she has met here, and the only one that was kind.": "她在这里遇见的唯一一颗星，也是唯一温柔的一颗。",
  "Reads omens. She thinks he is guessing.": "解读预兆。她觉得他只是在瞎猜。",
  "Says omens are guesses. Corvin says time is a crow that has not landed yet.": "说预兆不过是猜测。科尔文说，时间是一只还没落地的乌鸦。",
  "Keeps finding doors she has already walked through.": "总能找到她早已走过的门。",
  "Every door he opens, she has already been through. It is maddening.": "他打开的每一扇门，她都早已走过。真让人抓狂。",
  "The only one who can walk through the doors he does.": "唯一能穿过他所穿之门的人。",
  "Walks through her glass as if it were a door. For her, it mostly is.": "把她的玻璃当门穿过。对她来说，那多半就是门。",
  "His crows will not fly near Noct. Noct has not asked why.": "他的乌鸦不肯飞近诺克特。诺克特也没问为什么。",
  "The one thing his crows will not fly near.": "他的乌鸦唯一不肯靠近的东西。",
  "Copies faces. Mira reflects them. In a mirror, Rue is nothing.": "模仿面孔。米拉映照面孔。在镜子里，露什么都不是。",
  "Looked at her in a mirror and saw nothing. Rue has hated mirrors since.": "在镜中看她，什么也没看见。从此露就恨上了镜子。",
  "Bends light through her glass in ways neither knew it could go.": "让光穿过她的玻璃，弯出两人都不知道的角度。",
  "Her glass bends Lux's light further than it has ever gone.": "她的玻璃让卢克丝的光弯折得前所未有地远。",
  "Twin brother. Worries. She curses him for it.": "孪生兄弟。爱操心。她为此诅咒他。",
  "Twin sister. He would give the last of his world for her.": "孪生姐妹。为了她，他愿交出自己世界仅剩的一切。",
  "Tried to copy her and felt everything twice for a week. Hex found it funny.": "试图模仿她，结果一周里每种感觉都来了两遍。赫克丝觉得很好笑。",
  "Copied her once. Felt everything twice for a week.": "模仿过她一次。一周里什么都感受了两遍。",
  "Asked what she looked like underneath, and waited for the answer.": "问她面孔之下是什么模样，然后等着回答。",
  "Has no shape either. He asked what she looked like underneath. She found out.": "同样没有形状。他问她面孔之下是什么模样。她找到了答案。",
  "Her sister. Keeps her bright when the glass gets heavy.": "她的姐妹。玻璃变得沉重时，让她保持明亮。",
  "Her sister, who glassed a desert by being afraid. Lux keeps her bright.": "她的姐妹，因为害怕把一片沙漠变成了玻璃。卢克丝让她保持明亮。",
  "Brings her bees honey from somewhere. Nobody asks where.": "不知从哪儿给她的蜜蜂弄来蜂蜜。没人问从哪儿来。",
  "Brings honey for the swarm. She has decided not to ask where from.": "给蜂群带来蜂蜜。她决定不问是从哪儿来的。",
  "Rides a kite and thinks that counts as flying. Stays up almost as long.": "骑着风筝，就以为那算飞。在空中待得几乎和她一样久。",
  "Stays in the air longer than Sora. Sora cannot stand it.": "在空中待得比索拉还久。索拉受不了这一点。",
  "Light and dark need someone between them. She stays at his side.": "光与暗之间需要有人。她守在他身边。",
  "Came through the tear beside him, and has not left it.": "与他并肩穿过裂隙，从此再没离开他身旁。",
  "Sworn brother. Wants to rush. Between them, they are usually on time.": "结义兄弟。总想快。两人凑在一起，通常刚好准时。",
  "Sworn brother. Wants to wait. Between them, they are usually on time.": "结义兄弟。总想等。两人凑在一起，通常刚好准时。",
  "Another wall that wants to be the hardest thing on the mountain. Brakk lets him and Taro argue about it.": "又一堵想当山上最硬之物的墙。布拉克随他和太郎去争。",
  "A mountain that walked up through rock. Thinks Tor and Taro are both very loud.": "一座穿过岩层走上来的山。觉得托尔和太郎都太吵了。",
  "Sold the students who trusted him. Sen took one of them in, and keeps his sword between her and him.": "出卖了信任他的学生。森恩收留了其中一个，并把自己的剑横在她与他之间。",
  "A swordsman who teaches in a rusted metro car. He took in the student Pell sold.": "一个在锈蚀地铁车厢里授课的剑客。他收留了佩尔出卖的那个学生。",
  "The smiling mask that took a little girl from his temple. The bell has not forgiven him.": "那张从他寺里带走一个小女孩的笑脸面具。钟声至今没有原谅他。",
  "A monk who only rings a bell. Pell took his best pupil up to the sky anyway.": "一个只会敲钟的僧人。佩尔照样把他最好的弟子带上了天空。",
  "Its faces. Any face it needed, for a whole season.": "它的面孔。整整一季，它要什么脸就有什么脸。",
  "Wore every face it asked for, and never once her own. Not any more.": "它要哪张脸，她就戴哪张，却从没戴过自己的。如今不会了。",
  "Wore his face to set the Sky against Deepline. He has not decided what to do about that.": "戴着他的脸，挑起了天空与深线的仇恨。他还没想好该拿这事怎么办。",
  "Wore his face once, for the Director. It never fit.": "为总监戴过一次他的脸。从来都不合适。",
  "Wore her face to turn Deepline against the Sky. Nyra wants it back.": "戴着她的脸，让深线与天空反目。妮拉想把它要回来。",
  "Wore her face once, to sell out the tunnels. Nyra looked at her as if she understood.": "为了出卖地道，戴过一次她的脸。妮拉看她的眼神，像是懂了。",
  "The faceless thing in the next cell of the Blank Wing. He kept watch on it for a year.": "空白侧楼隔壁牢房里那个没有脸的东西。他盯了它一整年。",
  "The cell beside hers. He never wore a face either, and she never managed to copy him.": "她隔壁的牢房。他也从不露脸，而她始终没能复制他。",
  "Wants to close every tear today. She keeps up with him easily, from above.": "想今天就合上每一道裂隙。她轻松跟得上他，在高处。",
  "Came through the tear beside him and Ryo, and has still not touched the ground.": "和他与亮一同穿过裂隙而来，至今还没落过地。",
  // the Chronicle, rewritten to The Hollow Crown (2026-11-17)
  "Prologue: Three Layers": "序章：三层世界",
  "In 2091 the Ashfall War burned the world in forty-one days. Afterwards the rich went up, to Aurelia, a city of gold towers floating on anti-gravity pylons. The poor went down, into the old metro lines, and called it Deepline. Everyone else was left on the Surface, with the dunes, the glass and the wind.": "2091年，落灰战争在41天里烧遍了整个世界。此后，富人往上走，去了奥蕾莉亚——一座由反重力塔柱托起、金色高塔林立的浮空之城。穷人往下走，钻进旧地铁线路，把那里叫作深线。其余所有人都被留在地表，与沙丘、玻璃和风为伴。",
  "On the first night after the war, a handful of families met round a fire on a mountain and refused to choose. They swore the Pact of Three Layers: to live in the sky, on the ground and under it, all at once, and to keep the three from killing each other. A young monk named Oda rang a bell over the oath. A young hermit named Hollis wrote it down.": "战后第一夜，几户人家在一座山上围着篝火相聚，拒绝做出选择。他们立下三层之约：同时活在天上、地面和地下，并且不让这三层自相残杀。一位名叫奥达的年轻僧人为这份誓言敲响了钟。一位名叫霍利斯的年轻隐士把它写了下来。",
  "They became the Hidden Clans. Their village sits in a fold of the Surface mountains that no map shows. Garo keeps its forge and Tor its gate; Taro holds the ring where its children learn to fall; Ivo trains there every morning before the sun is up. Oda has not spoken a word since the night of the oath. He lets the bell talk.": "他们成了隐秘氏族。他们的村落藏在地表群山的一道褶皱里，任何地图上都没有。加罗掌管村里的锻炉，托尔把守村门；太郎镇守土俵，村里的孩子在那里学习怎样摔倒；伊沃每天清晨不等太阳升起就在那里练功。自从立誓那一夜起，奥达就再没说过一个字。他让钟替他说话。",
  "1. The Engine Turns": "1. 引擎转动",
  "In 2187 Halcyon, the company that rules Aurelia, finished the Convergence Engine under its Spire. Dr. Veyra Kessen built it to keep the city in the sky. Director Calder Sayle ordered it to full power. Nobody else in the room argued.": "2187年，统治奥蕾莉亚的公司哈尔西恩在尖塔之下建成了交汇引擎。维拉·凯森博士造它，是为了让这座城市留在天上。卡尔德·塞尔总监下令让它全功率运转。房间里没有别人提出异议。",
  "It tore two worlds into ours. Vharra, the storm steppe, and the Frozen Harbour came through in pieces, and their people landed scattered across all three layers. They remembered everything: their names, their homes, the faces of the people they lost. They were refugees in a world that did not want them, and they knew exactly what had been taken.": "它把两个世界撕进了我们的世界。风暴草原瓦拉和冰封港湾一块一块地掉了进来，两个世界的人散落在三层各处。他们什么都记得：自己的名字，自己的家，失去的那些人的脸。他们是一个不欢迎他们的世界里的难民，而且清清楚楚地知道自己被夺走了什么。",
  "The Engine tore one more hole, into the Beyond, the dark between worlds, and that hole never closed. Only one thing came through it then: a shape with no face, no voice and no name. Pell found it in the Blank Wing, called it Rue, and taught it to wear any face it was given.": "引擎还撕开了另一个洞，通向彼岸——世界之间的黑暗——而那个洞始终没有合上。当时从洞里出来的只有一样东西：一个没有脸、没有声音、也没有名字的形体。佩尔在空白侧楼发现了它，给它取名叫露，又教它戴上别人给它的任何一张脸。",
  "Halcyon caught whoever had come through with power in them, numbered them as Subjects and drained them into the Engine. What was left was a Husk. And the Director, who listened to the Engine every night, began to hear something answering from the far side of the dark.": "哈尔西恩抓走了所有带着力量穿越而来的人，把他们编号为实验体，再把他们的力量抽干，灌进引擎。剩下的就是空壳。而每晚都在倾听引擎的总监，开始听见黑暗的另一头有什么东西在回应。",
  "2. The Subjects": "2. 实验体",
  "In Med-Lab Sector 7, Subject 31 sang her tank open. Nyra was a tidesinger of the Frozen Harbour, and the first thing she saw outside the glass were the Husks no one else would look at. In Cryo Vault 9 the eldest Subject, Isolde, a falconer of ice, taught her to keep her voice low. Maren, a harbour doctor kept to patch up what the tests broke, kept her alive the night they ran.": "在7区医疗实验室，31号实验体用歌声打开了自己的培养槽。妮拉是冰封港湾的唱潮人，她在玻璃外看到的第一样东西，是那些别人都不愿看一眼的空壳。在9号冷冻库，年纪最大的实验体、冰之驯鹰人伊索德，教她把声音压低。玛伦是港湾的医生，被留下来修补测试弄坏的东西；他们出逃的那一夜，是她保住了妮拉的命。",
  "In the Burn Ward, Pyra spent six weeks as Halcyon's furnace. In the seventh, the bottle broke. Elixa, Halcyon's own chief alchemist, who made the ward's serums, slipped her the cure for the sedatives and asked for nothing back. In the Firing Gallery, Yara was told to shoot at a target a mile away; it was never a ship.": "在烧伤病房，派拉当了六个星期哈尔西恩的熔炉。到第七个星期，瓶子碎了。哈尔西恩自己的首席炼金师、为病房调制血清的艾莉克莎，偷偷塞给她镇静剂的解药，什么回报也没要。在射击廊，雅拉奉命射击一英里外的一个靶子；那从来都不是一艘船。",
  "Subject 12 was the Director's finest knight. Aldric had been captain of the Frozen Harbour's sea wall, and he guarded the Proving Hall as if the wall still stood. In the Night Ward a red scarf lit the lamps that nobody saw lit: Vesper, the harbour's lamplighter, who moved through Halcyon's halls one shadow at a time and counted the Husks in the feed lines.": "12号实验体是总监麾下最出色的骑士。奥德瑞曾是冰封港湾海堤的队长，他守卫试炼大厅，就好像那道海堤仍然屹立。在夜间病房，一条红围巾点亮了一盏盏灯，却从没有人看见灯是怎么亮的：那是港湾的点灯人韦斯帕，她在哈尔西恩的走廊里从一片影子挪到另一片影子，清点着供能管线里的空壳。",
  "3. Under the Gold": "3. 黄金之下",
  "On the Noble Ring, Zara's House Edge took the nobles' money every night and sent it down to Deepline every morning. Coda danced for the Director's guests at the opera with Pell's strings on every step, and smiled while she did it. Isa kept the Archive and read what Halcyon wrote about all of them.": "在贵族环区，扎拉的庄家优势赌坊每晚收走贵族们的钱，每天早上又把钱送下深线。寇妲在歌剧院里为总监的宾客起舞，每一步都牵着佩尔的线，她一边跳一边微笑。伊莎掌管档案馆，读着哈尔西恩写下的关于他们所有人的记录。",
  "Under the gold, in the Ballast Decks, the Sky Clan kept the Pact alive. Lin trained there in the dark between the counterweights; Kestra, who believes she is the true phoenix, burned there and told everyone so. Zara owed Lin her life, and paid in a currency nobody else could see.": "黄金之下，在压舱甲板里，天空氏族让盟约延续着。琳在配重块之间的黑暗中练功；凯斯特拉相信自己才是真正的凤凰，她在那里燃烧，还逢人便说。扎拉欠琳一条命，用一种别人都看不见的货币偿还。",
  "Above it all flew the Paper Post. Gale fell to the bottom of the world in the Vent Stacks and rode the updraft back up. He found his sister Sora on the towers, and Kiri, a paper-folder from the Paper Shrine whose cranes carried letters Halcyon wanted unsent. Three kites and a promise: every letter arrives.": "在这一切之上飞翔的，是纸鹤邮驿。盖尔在排风塔里一路坠到世界的最底层，又乘着上升气流飞了回来。他在高塔上找到了妹妹索拉，还找到了基里——纸之神社的折纸人，她的纸鹤专门投递哈尔西恩不想让人寄出的信。三只风筝，一个承诺：每封信都会送到。",
  "4. The Wide Land": "4. 广袤大地",
  "Mile Zero is where every road on the Surface starts, and the Long Bar sees all of them. Jax keeps a gun on the bar and a tab nobody pays. Tarn runs messages down roads no truck will take, and has raced Gale eleven times. In the Ice House, Brann, a hunter from Vharra's frozen north, keeps the winter in a building the desert keeps trying to melt.": "零英里是地表所有道路的起点，长吧台把每一条都看在眼里。杰克斯在吧台上放着一把枪，还有一本谁也不付的赊账。塔恩沿着卡车都不肯走的路送信，跟盖尔赛跑过十一次。在冰窖里，来自瓦拉冰封北地的猎人布兰，把冬天守在一座沙漠一直想把它融化的房子里。",
  "In the Ash Dunes, Dune guards the Buried Meridian, a whole city under the sand, against Tarek's chain raiders, and Tarek wants what is under it as badly as she wants to keep it buried. In the Glowwild, Ume grows beautiful poison and Kova runs with the beasts; across the Glass Sea and the Tether Fields the caravans move under Hart's spear.": "在灰烬沙丘，杜恩守护着被掩埋的子午线——一整座埋在沙下的城市——抵御塔里克的锁链掠夺者；塔里克有多想要沙下的东西，她就有多想让它一直埋着。在荧野，梅种着美丽的毒物，科瓦与野兽同奔；穿过玻璃之海和系缆原野，商队在哈特的长矛护卫下前行。",
  "Two of Vharra's children landed on the Surface. Fenn, a beast-caller, broke out of Halcyon's Beast Pens with a storm-wolf at his heel. Brakk, the warden of a ring of standing stones, came up through Shaft Nine as if the rock had carried him. Hollis found Brakk sitting on a mountain and invited him in. Brakk said the mountain could come too.": "瓦拉有两个孩子落在了地表。驭兽人芬恩逃出了哈尔西恩的兽栏，脚边紧跟着一头风暴之狼。一圈立石的守卫布拉克从九号竖井里钻了上来，仿佛是岩石把他托上来的。霍利斯发现布拉克坐在一座山上，便请他到村里来。布拉克说，山也可以一起来。",
  "5. The City Under the City": "5. 城下之城",
  "A tear opened over Deepline's Crusher Yard and a boy fell out of a storm. Kael of Vharra, the thunder of the storm clans, landed in the trash, and Ferra, who decides what in the Yard is worth saving, decided he was. Halcyon's collectors came for him the same night. They left without him.": "深线粉碎场上空裂开了一道裂隙，一个男孩从风暴里掉了出来。瓦拉的凯尔，风暴氏族的雷霆，落进了垃圾堆；而费拉——粉碎场里什么东西值得留下，由她说了算——认定他值得。当天夜里，哈尔西恩的收集者就来抓他。他们空手而归。",
  "The Lantern Cell trained in secret under its sensei, Pell: Rook, who fights like a wall with fists; Sable, who listens to the dark; Moro, whose shadow does what he tells it. Pell taught them everything except who he reported to. In the Neon Market, Vesna's Red Ledger kept the debts of every soul in Deepline; the Pit Arena settled everything the Ledger could not.": "灯笼小队在他们的老师佩尔手下秘密训练：鲁克，打起架来像一堵长了拳头的墙；萨布尔，倾听黑暗；莫罗，他的影子对他言听计从。佩尔把一切都教给了他们，唯独没说自己听命于谁。在霓虹市场，维斯娜的赤色账簿记着深线每一个人的债；账簿了结不了的，就交给深坑竞技场了结。",
  "Sen taught the sword in a rusted metro car and called it the Rust Dojo. Bando worked Dockside Nine, Dyna blew things up at the Scrapworks for a living, Mako walked the docks in a suit of armour, Vex ran a yard of iron that came home when it was called, and Fumi kept the pipes from bursting. Below them, in the Core Sump, Halcyon kept Ashka, a woman of the harbour's deep vents, and bled her heat into the city.": "森恩在一节生锈的地铁车厢里教剑，管那里叫锈蚀道场。班多在九号码头干活，黛娜在废料工坊靠炸东西谋生，马科穿着一身盔甲在码头上走来走去，维克斯经营着一座铁料场，场里的铁一唤就会自己回家，芙美则负责不让管道爆裂。在他们下面的核心污水坑里，哈尔西恩关着阿什卡——一个来自港湾深层热泉的女人——把她的热量一点点放出来，供给整座城市。",
  "Lower still: the Waterworks and the Fungal Hollows, the flooded Drowned Line where Nami, who was born there, swims with things that should not be alive, and the catacombs where Thorne keeps a garden of bone and asks the dead how they are.": "再往下：是水厂和菌菇洞窟，是被水淹没的溺亡线——生在那里的奈美在那里与一些本不该活着的东西一同游弋——还有地下墓穴，索恩在那里照料一座骸骨花园，问候死者近来可好。",
  "6. The Faceless Spy": "6. 无面密探",
  "Pell taught the Lantern Cell in Deepline and reported to the Director in the Spire, and nobody in either place knew about the other. His best tool was Rue. She could be anyone for a day: a guard, a noble, a girl from the Slums, a boy from the Crusher Yard.": "佩尔在深线教导灯笼小队，又在尖塔向总监汇报，而两边谁都不知道另一边的存在。他手里最好用的工具是露。她可以在一天之内成为任何人：一个守卫，一个贵族，一个贫民窟的女孩，一个粉碎场的男孩。",
  "Kiri met her first. In the Paper Shrine a folder of cranes came in with a face Kiri knew and a voice that was slightly wrong, and Kiri's cranes would not land on her. They fought among the paper, and Rue left wearing someone else.": "基里是第一个遇上她的。纸之神社里来了一个折纸鹤的人，长着一张基里认识的脸，声音却有点不对，基里的纸鹤怎么也不肯落到她身上。两人在纸堆里打了起来，露离开时，已经换上了另一个人的脸。",
  "By the time the Director needed a war, Rue had worn half of Deepline and half of Aurelia, and had never once worn her own face. She did not have one.": "等到总监需要一场战争的时候，露已经戴过半个深线、半个奥蕾莉亚的脸，却从没戴过一次自己的脸。她根本没有。",
  "7. False Faces": "7. 假面",
  "The Director knew the three layers would turn on him together, so he made sure they turned on each other first. Rue put on Kael's face and opened the Core Sump's vents on Halcyon's labs; people died in those labs. Then she put on Nyra's face and led Halcyon's drills into the Deepline tunnels.": "总监知道，三层会联手对付他，所以他确保它们先彼此反目。露戴上凯尔的脸，把核心污水坑的通风口对着哈尔西恩的实验室打开；那些实验室里死了人。随后她又戴上妮拉的脸，把哈尔西恩的钻机领进了深线的隧道。",
  "Each layer believed the other had attacked it. Aurelia saw a Deepline boy burn its labs. Deepline saw an escaped Subject sell its hideouts. The Surface saw drills coming down out of the sky. The war of the layers began exactly the way the Director wanted, and he watched it from the Spire with the Engine humming under his feet.": "每一层都以为是另一层袭击了自己。奥蕾莉亚看见一个深线男孩烧了它的实验室。深线看见一个逃走的实验体出卖了它的藏身处。地表看见钻机从天而降。诸层之战完全照着总监的心意打响了；他站在尖塔上观战，引擎在他脚下嗡嗡作响。",
  "8. The War of the Layers": "8. 诸层之战",
  "The Siege of the Noble Ring. The Proving Hall marched on the nobles. Vesper took Aldric down to the Engine's feed lines and showed him the Husks; Aldric broke his oath to the Director to keep the older one, and turned his knights around. Coda cut her strings in the middle of the opera and danced Pell's secrets out for every noble to read.": "贵族环区之围。试炼大厅向贵族们进军。韦斯帕带奥德瑞下到引擎的供能管线，让他看那些空壳；奥德瑞背弃了对总监的誓言，为了守住更早的那一个，并让他的骑士们掉转了方向。寇妲在歌剧演到一半时斩断了自己身上的线，把佩尔的秘密一一舞了出来，让每个贵族都看得一清二楚。",
  "The Drills at the Buried Meridian. Halcyon's drills sank into the buried city and the Glass Sea. Dune and Tarek, enemies for years, ended up holding the same chain against them. In the mountains the Hidden Village rang Oda's bell three times, and the clans came down.": "钻机直逼被掩埋的子午线。哈尔西恩的钻机钻进了那座被掩埋的城市和玻璃之海。杜恩和塔里克做了多年的仇敌，最后却握着同一根锁链与钻机对抗。在山里，隐秘村落把奥达的钟敲了三下，氏族们下山了。",
  "The Strings Cut. In the Pit Arena the Lantern Cell caught their own sensei in his own Cat's Cradle. Vesna opened the Red Ledger at its longest page, Halcyon's, and called in every debt at once. The Core Sump was broken open, and Ashka walked out of it carrying a year of stolen heat.": "丝线斩断。在深坑竞技场，灯笼小队用老师自己的翻花绳，困住了他们的老师。维斯娜翻开赤色账簿最长的那一页——哈尔西恩的那一页——一口气催讨所有的债。核心污水坑被砸开了，阿什卡从里面走了出来，带着被偷走的一整年的热量。",
  "9. Four Banners": "9. 四面旗帜",
  "Kael and Nyra, each sure the other was a Halcyon agent, met at the Crater under a violet sky and fought. At the Pit, the Lantern Cell had caught Pell in his own Cat's Cradle, and Pell named the face behind the war: Rue. Kiri flew the word to the Crater. When \"Kael\" was seen in the crowd while the real Kael stood in front of Nyra, Rue ran.": "凯尔和妮拉都认定对方是哈尔西恩的特工，两人在紫色天空下的陨坑相遇，打了起来。在深坑，灯笼小队用佩尔自己的翻花绳困住了他，佩尔说出了这场战争背后的那张脸：露。基里把消息飞送到陨坑。真正的凯尔站在妮拉面前时，人群中却有人看见了“凯尔”——露逃走了。",
  "Hollis took out the Pact of Three Layers and added a line under it: the Hidden Clans would no longer hide. Four banners went up the mountain road that night, Aurelia's, the Surface's, Deepline's and the Clans', and Oda rang the bell once.": "霍利斯取出三层之约，在下面添了一行：隐秘氏族不再隐藏。那天夜里，四面旗帜沿着山路升了上去——奥蕾莉亚的、地表的、深线的，还有氏族的——奥达敲了一下钟。",
  "10. The Spire": "10. 尖塔",
  "They climbed the Halcyon Spire from four sides at once. Tor and Hart held the gate. Yara shot the guns off the towers from a mile away. Jax took the lift. Sora flew the plan to every floor before the alarms knew there was a plan.": "他们从四个方向同时攀上哈尔西恩尖塔。托尔和哈特守住了大门。雅拉在一英里外把塔楼上的炮一门门打了下来。杰克斯坐上了升降梯。索拉把计划送到了每一层楼，那时警报还不知道有计划这回事。",
  "Halcyon cut the pylons to drop Aurelia on the attackers. Dr. Kessen rerouted them by hand from Pylon Chamber Six while Aldric held the chamber door against the Spire's guard. The whole city dropped one floor, groaned, and held.": "哈尔西恩切断了塔柱，要让奥蕾莉亚砸在进攻者头上。凯森博士在六号塔柱室里亲手为塔柱改接线路，奥德瑞则守住塔柱室的门，挡住尖塔的卫兵。整座城市往下沉了一层，呻吟了一声，撑住了。",
  "On the floor of the Engine the heroes beat the Director. He stepped back into its light, and the Engine took him in. What came out was the Convergence. With the last of what was human in him, it did what he had wanted to do since the first test: it opened the Beyond all the way, and called.": "在引擎的地面上，英雄们打败了总监。他向后退进引擎的光里，引擎把他收了进去。出来的是交汇。凭着他身上最后残存的人性，它做了他从第一次测试起就想做的事：把彼岸彻底打开，然后发出召唤。",
  "11. The Hollow Crown": "11. 空冠",
  "The sky over the Crater split from horizon to horizon, and something the size of a city came down, shaped like a crown with nothing inside it. Sovereign Vael rules an empire of engines in the dark between worlds. His army is the Hollow Legion: hundreds of thousands of soldiers emptied out of the worlds he has eaten. The voice the Director heard in the Engine for a year was his.": "陨坑上空从地平线到地平线裂成两半，一个城市大小的东西降了下来，形状像一顶里面空无一物的王冠。君主维尔统治着世界之间黑暗中的一个引擎帝国。他的军队是空冠军团：数十万名士兵，都是从他吞噬过的世界里掏空而来的。总监这一年来在引擎里听见的声音，就是他的。",
  "The Convergence gave Vael the door; Vael promised it a throne over three worlds. Then Vael's champions came down: fourteen Beyond-born who serve him, each marked with his empty crown, and nobody in the three layers had ever seen them before. Rue sold herself to him the same night.": "交汇把门交给了维尔；维尔许诺给它一个统御三个世界的王座。随后，维尔的勇士们降临了：十四个为他效力的彼岸来客，每一个都带着他那顶空冠的印记，三层里从没有人见过他们。当天夜里，露把自己卖给了他。",
  "They struck all three layers at once. Vega came to let Aurelia fall, Lux to burn the Noble Ring white, Mira to turn the city's glass on it, Tessa to unwrite the Archive, Mika to cut the Skylift and Corvin to put out the sun. Opal turned the Surface to glass, Apis's swarm ate into the Glowwild and Ryo tipped the Tether Fields over. Noct cut Deepline's lights, Orin opened doors for the Legion, Rue wore the faces of its leaders, Slick flooded the pumps and Hex woke the dead.": "他们同时袭击了三层。维加来让奥蕾莉亚坠落，卢克丝来把贵族环区烧成一片白，米拉来让城市的玻璃反过来对准城市，泰莎来把档案馆的记载一笔笔抹去，米卡来斩断天梯，科尔文来熄灭太阳。欧泊把地表变成了玻璃，阿琵斯的蜂群啃进了荧野，亮掀翻了系缆原野。诺克特掐灭了深线的灯，欧林为军团打开一扇扇门，露戴上了深线首领们的脸，滑溜淹了水泵，赫克丝唤醒了死者。",
  "Every layer fought on its own ground and nobody could come to help anybody else. Nyra, Aldric and Maren held Pylon Chamber Six; Pyra and Yara the Noble Ring; Isolde, Kiri, Zara and Vesper the Skyport. Brakk and Dune stood on the Glass Sea, Fenn and Ume in the Glowwild, Hollis and Oda on the Tether Fields. Sen, Ashka and Sable kept a light burning in the Old Metro, Pell met Rue in the Neon Market, Nami met Slick at the Waterworks and Thorne met Hex in the Roots. One by one, the champions fell back to the Crown.": "每一层都在自己的地盘上作战，谁也无法去援救别人。妮拉、奥德瑞和玛伦守住了六号塔柱室；派拉和雅拉守住了贵族环区；伊索德、基里、扎拉和韦斯帕守住了天港。布拉克和杜恩坚守在玻璃之海，芬恩和梅坚守在荧野，霍利斯和奥达坚守在系缆原野。森恩、阿什卡和萨布尔在旧地铁里守着一盏不灭的灯，佩尔在霓虹市场迎战露，奈美在水厂迎战滑溜，索恩在根脉迎战赫克丝。勇士们一个接一个地退回了空冠。",
  "12. Over the Crater": "12. 陨坑之上",
  "Itsuki is the strongest fighter in any world, and Vael sent him at the Surface's heart. In the Ash Dunes he beat Ivo, then Tarn, then Jax, then Brann. Kael came up from Deepline and held him longer than anyone, and lost too. Nobody stopped him. Itsuki looked at the five of them in the sand, turned, and walked back to stand under the Crown and wait.": "一树是所有世界里最强的战士，维尔派他去攻打地表的心脏。在灰烬沙丘，他打败了伊沃，然后是塔恩，然后是杰克斯，然后是布兰。凯尔从深线赶上来，撑得比谁都久，可也输了。没有人拦得住他。一树看了看倒在沙里的五个人，转过身，走回空冠之下，站在那里等着。",
  "So the three layers came to the Crater together, every hero who could still stand. The Legion poured down out of the crown-ship. Itsuki was waiting at the foot of it, calm, the five elements turning around him, the last champion between them and Vael. They went through him, and it was the hardest fight any of them ever had.": "于是三层一同来到陨坑，每一个还站得起来的英雄都来了。军团从王冠之舰里倾泻而下。一树在舰下等着，神色平静，五种元素在他身周流转，他是挡在众人与维尔之间的最后一名勇士。他们闯过了他，那是他们每个人此生最艰难的一战。",
  "Inside, the Convergence and Vael fought side by side, the last two engines. The Convergence came apart into light, and the heroes of the three layers broke Sovereign Vael on the floor of his own crown. The crown-ship fell into the Crater, the door to the Beyond slammed shut, and it pulled the Legion and every champion back through with it. Itsuki was the last to go. He did not look back.": "在里面，交汇和维尔并肩作战，那是最后的两台引擎。交汇在光芒中分崩离析，三层的英雄们在君主维尔自己那顶王冠的地面上击垮了他。王冠之舰坠入陨坑，通往彼岸的门砰然关闭，把军团和每一名勇士都一起拖了回去。一树是最后一个离开的。他没有回头。",
  "Epilogue: Together": "尾声：一起",
  "Kessen turned the Engine backwards, once, and sealed what was left of the door.": "凯森让引擎倒转了一次，把那扇门残存的缺口封死了。",
  "Aurelia settled onto the Surface over a year, one floor at a time. The torn-through who wanted to go home to Vharra and the Frozen Harbour could, and some did; Fenn's storm-wolf ran ahead of him into the steppe and waited at the edge to see if he would follow. Most stayed.": "奥蕾莉亚花了一年时间，一层一层地降落到地表上。那些穿过裂隙而来、想回瓦拉和冰封港湾老家的人，可以回去了，也有一些人真的回去了；芬恩的风暴之狼抢先跑进草原，停在边缘等着，看他会不会跟上来。大多数人留了下来。",
  "Oda rang the bell once, and broke his vow of silence to say one word over the Pact. Hollis says the word was \"together\". Oda is not saying.": "奥达敲了一下钟，打破沉默之誓，在盟约之上说了一个词。霍利斯说，那个词是“一起”。奥达不置一词。"
});
